helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148664	1			0	nb	\<variable id=\"chart_main\"\>\<link href=\"text/schart/main0000.xhp\" name=\"Charts in $[officename]\"\>Bruke diagrammer i %PRODUCTNAME\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154685	2			0	nb	\<variable id=\"chart\"\>Med $[officename] kan du presentere data grafisk i et diagram, slik at du visuelt kan sammenligne dataserier og se trender i dataene. Du kan sette inn diagrammer i regneark, tekstdokumenter, tegninger og presentasjoner.\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153143	5			0	nb	Diagramdata				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id5181432				0	nb	Diagrammer kan bygge på følgende data:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id7787102				0	nb	Regnearkverdier fra celleområder i Calc				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id7929929				0	nb	Celleverdier fra en tabell i Writer				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id4727011				0	nb	Verdier du skriver inn i dialogvinduet \<emph\>Diagramdatatabell\</emph\> (du kan lage disse diagrammene i Writer, Draw eller Impress, og du kan også lime dem inn i Calc)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	par_id76601				0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Creates a chart in the current document. To use a continuous range of cells as the data source for your chart, click inside the cell range, and then choose this command. Alternatively, select some cells and choose this command to create a chart of the selected cells.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\main0000.xhp	0	help	hd_id5345011				0	nb	Sette inn et diagram				20130618 17:22:18
