helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154232	1			0	nb	\<variable id=\"programming\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/main0600.xhp\" name=\"Programming $[officename]\"\>Programmering i $[officename]\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149760	2			0	nb	\<variable id=\"basic\"\>$[officename] kan styres med $[officename]-API-et.\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0600.xhp	0	help	par_id3151111	12			0	nb	$[officename] har et programmeringsgrensesnitt (API) som du kan bruke til å styre $[officename] ved hjelp av flere programmeringsspråk. Det finnes en utviklerverktøykasse (Software Development Kit – SDK) for programmeringsgrensesnittet i $[officename].				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156346	15			0	nb	Du kan lese mer om API-et i $[officename] ved å gå til http://api.openoffice.org/				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0600.xhp	0	help	par_id3153825	13			0	nb	Makroer som er laget med $[officename] Basic i det gamle programmeringsgrensesnittet kan ikke brukes i denne versjonen.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149795	14			0	nb	Du kan lese mer om $[officename] Basic ved å velge «$[officename] Basic» i listeboksen.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	tit				0	nb	Java-plattformstøtte				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153089	1			0	nb	\<link href=\"text/shared/main0650.xhp\" name=\"Java Platform Support\"\>Java-plattformstøtte\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363	2			0	nb	$[officename] støtter Java-plattformen, som kan brukes til å kjøre programmer, miniprogrammer og komponenter som er basert på JavaBeans-arkitekturen.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751	3			0	nb	For $[officename] to support the Java platform, you must install the Java 2 Runtime Environment software. When you installed $[officename], you automatically received the option to install these files if they were not yet installed. You can also install these files now if required.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3155338	4			0	nb	Støtte for Java-plattformen må slås på i $[officename] for å kunne kjøre Java-programmer.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3155892	5			0	nb	Slå på støtte for Java ved å velge \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME → Innstillinger\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Verktøy → Innstillinger\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/java.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] → Java\"\>$[officename] → Java\</link\>\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id9116183				0	nb	Before you can use a JDBC driver, you need to add its class path. Choose \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME- Java, and click the Class Path button. After you add the path information, restart %PRODUCTNAME.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3153822	11			0	nb	Your modifications at the \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - $[officename] - Java\</emph\> tab page will be used even if the Java Virtual Machine (JVM, a virtual machine for the Java platform) already has been started. After modifications to the ClassPath you must restart $[officename]. The same is true for modifications under \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Internet - Proxy\</emph\>. Only the two boxes "Http Proxy" and "Ftp Proxy" and their ports don't require a restart, they will be evaluated when you click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
