helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\autotext.xhp	0	help	par_id3145615	28			0	nb	Velg \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02120000.xhp\" name=\"Rediger → Autotekst\"\>\<emph\>Rediger → Autotekst\</emph\>\</link\>.				20130618 17:22:18
