helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_pagestyles.xhp	0	help	par_id3147061	40			0	nb	I boksen \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Neste stil\</item\>               \<emph/\>, velg «Høyreside».				20130618 17:22:18
