helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150520	24			0	nb	To add a separator line between the header or the footer and the content of the page, click the bottom edge of the square in the \<emph\>Line arrangement\</emph\> area. Click a line style in the \<emph\>Style\</emph\> box.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3153742	25			0	nb	To adjust the spacing between the content of the header or footer and the line, clear the \<emph\>Synchronize\</emph\> box, and then enter a value in the\<emph\> Bottom\</emph\> box.				20130618 17:22:18
