helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	tit				0	nb	Bruk av smarte tagger				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155622				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>smart tags\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>AutoCorrect function; smart tags\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>options;smart tags\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>disabling;smart tags\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>installing;smart tags\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	hd_id3563951				0	nb	\<variable id=\"smarttags\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/smarttags.xhp\"\>Bruk av smarte tagger\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id368358				0	nb	Smarte tagger gir mer informasjon og funksjoner til utvalgte ord i et Writer-dokument. De tilgjengelige funksjonene kan være forskjellige i ulike utvidelser.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	hd_id9298379				0	nb	Installere smarte tagger				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id1827448				0	nb	Smarte tagger kan leveres som \<link href=\"text/shared/01/packagemanager.xhp\"\>utvidelser\</link\> til %PRODUCTNAME Writer. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id2508621				0	nb	Gjør følgende for å installere en smart tagg:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id3856013				0	nb	Lagre fila med filetternavnet *.oxt, dobbeltklikk på fila i filbehandleren. Alternativt, i %PRODUCTNAME velg \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Verktøy → Utvidelser\</item\> for å åpne dialogvinduet Utvidelser , klikk på Legg til og finn fila.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id7814264				0	nb	Dobbeltklikk på en smart tagg *.oxt-lenke på en nettside. Dette krever en en riktig oppsatt nettleser.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	hd_id8142338				0	nb	Smarte tagger-menyen				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id1917477				0	nb	Any text in a Writer document can be marked with a Smart Tag, by default a magenta colored underline. You can change the color in \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - Appearance\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id192266				0	nb	When you point to a Smart Tag, a tip help informs you to Ctrl-click to open the Smart Tags menu. If you don't use a mouse, position the cursor inside the marked text and open the context menu by Shift+F10.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id1998962				0	nb	In the Smart Tags menu you see the available actions that are defined for this Smart Tag. Choose an option from the menu. The \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Smart Tags Options\</item\> command opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040700.xhp\"\>Smart Tags\</link\> page of Tools - Autocorrect Options.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	hd_id2376476				0	nb	For å ta i bruk og slå av smarte tagger				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id349131				0	nb	Når du har installeret minst en smarttaggutvidelse, vil du se \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040700.xhp\"\>Smarte tagger\</link\> siden i dialogvinduet \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Verktøy → Autoretting\</item\>. Bruk dette dialogvinduet for å ta i bruk eller slå av smarte tagger og for å håndtere de installerte smarttaggene.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id1216467				0	nb	Tekst som gjenkjennes som en smarttagg blir ikke kontrolleret med den automatiske stavekontrollen.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	tit				0	nb	Checking Spelling and Grammar				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149684				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>spellcheck; checking text documents manually\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>checking spelling;manually\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>grammar checker\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149684	37			0	nb	\<variable id=\"spellcheck_dialog\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/spellcheck_dialog.xhp\" name=\"Checking Spelling and Grammar\"\>Checking Spelling and Grammar\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3149814	9			0	nb	You can manually check the spelling and grammar of a text selection or the entire document.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id0525200902184476				0	nb	For å kontrollere stavinga og grammatikken i en tekst, må den passende ordlista være innstallert. For en del språk finnes det tre forskjellige ordlister. En stavekontroll, en orddelingsliste og en synonymordliste. Hver ordliste dekker kun det ene språket. Grammatikkontrollere kan lastes ned og installeres som utvidelser. Se på \<link href=\"http://extensions.services.openoffice.org/dictionary\"\>nettsiden for utvidelser\</link\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3149828	10			0	nb	Stavekontrollen begynner ved plasseringa til skrivemerket eller ved begynnelsen av tekstvalget.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3155859	43			0	nb	Klikk i dokumentet, eller velg teksten som skal kontrolleres.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3149836	44			0	nb	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Spelling and Grammar\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3156104	45			0	nb	When a possible spelling error is encountered, the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Spellcheck\</item\>               \<emph/\>dialog opens and $[officename] offers some suggested corrections.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3149861	46			0	nb	Gjør dette:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3145099	47			0	nb	To accept a correction, click the suggestion, and then click \<emph\>Change\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3156241	48			0	nb	Edit the sentence in the upper text box, and then click \<emph\>Change\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3155886	40			0	nb	To add the unknown word to a user-defined dictionary, click \<emph\>Add\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
