helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156108				0	nb	\<variable id=\"table_sizing\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/table_sizing.xhp\" name=\"Ændre størrelse på rækker og kolonner i en teksttabel\"\>Endre størrelsen på rader og kolonner i en teksttabell\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3153140				0	nb	Du kan endre bredden på tabellceller og kolonner, og dessuten endre høyden på tabellrader.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3149615				0	nb	\<image id=\"img_id3149622\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_optimizetable.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149622\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3146497				0	nb	You can also distribute rows and columns evenly using the icons on the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Optimize\</item\> toolbar on the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Table\</item\> Bar.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145109				0	nb	Endre bredden på kolonner og celler				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149574				0	nb	To Change the Width of a Column				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3149587				0	nb	Do one of the following:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3156246				0	nb	La pekeren hvile på kolonnens skillelinje inntil den blir til et skilleikon, og dra så linja til en ny plassering.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3145390				0	nb	La pekeren hvile på kolonneskillelinja på linjalen inntil den blir til et skilleikon, og dra så linja til en ny plassering.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id0918200811260957				0	nb	Hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> and then click and drag a line to scale all cells right or above the line proportionally.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3145411				0	nb	Place the cursor in a cell in the column, hold down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key, and then press the left or the right arrow key.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3153364				0	nb	To increase the distance from the left edge of the page to the edge of the table, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift, and then press the right arrow key.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3155891				0	nb	You can specify the behavior for the arrow keys by choosing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\<emph\> - \</emph\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Table\</emph\>, and selecting the options that you want in the \<emph\>Keyboard handling\</emph\> area.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149993				0	nb	To Change the Width of a Cell				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3148676				0	nb	Hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option+Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt+Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then press the left or the right arrow key				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153014				0	nb	Endre høyden på en rad				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3153035				0	nb	To change the height of a row, place the cursor in a cell in the row, hold down the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key, and then press the up or the down arrow key.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	hd_id8478041				0	nb	Resizing a Whole Table				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id3358867				0	nb	For å endre bredden og høyden på en tabell, må du gjøre dette:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id5366679				0	nb	Klikk i tabellen. På linjalene drar du i kanten mellom det hvite og det grå området for å endre størrelsen på tabellen.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id1279030				0	nb	Klikk i tabellen. Velg \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tabell → Tabellegenskaper\</item\> for å åpne et dialogvindu og stille inn egenskapene for tallene.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id5009308				0	nb	To wrap text to the sides of a table, and to arrange two tables next to another, you must insert the tables into a frame. Click inside the table, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+A twice to select the whole table, then choose \<emph\>Insert - Frame\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\table_sizing.xhp	0	help	par_id4190496				0	nb	Tabeller inne i HTML-sider tilbyr ikke de samme egenskapene og kommandoene som tabeller i OpenDocument-formatet.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\tablemode.xhp	0	help	tit				0	nb	Endre rader og kolonner ved bruk av tastaturet				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\tablemode.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155856				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>table mode selection\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>proportional distribution of tables\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>relative distribution of table cells\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>tables; adapting the width by keyboard\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>cells; adapting the width by keyboard\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>keyboard;modifying the behavior of rows/columns\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>behavior of rows/columns\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\tablemode.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155856	7			0	nb	\<variable id=\"tablemode\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/tablemode.xhp\" name=\"Modifying the Behavior of Rows and Columns for Table\"\>Endre rader og kolonner ved bruk av tastaturet\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\tablemode.xhp	0	help	par_id3149835	12			0	nb	When you insert or delete cells, rows or columns in a table, the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Behavior of rows/columns\</item\> options determine how the neighboring elements are affected. For example, you can only insert new rows and columns into a table with fixed row and column dimensions if space permits.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\tablemode.xhp	0	help	par_id7344279				0	nb	Merk at disse egenskapene bare er gyldige for endringer av kolonnebredde som er lagd ved bruk av tastaturet. Ved bruk av musa, står du fritt til å endre kolonnebredde.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\tablemode.xhp	0	help	par_id3156110	8			0	nb	To set the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Behavior of rows/columns\</item\> options for tables in text documents, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Table\</item\>, or use the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Fixed\</item\>, \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Fixed/Proportional\</item\>, and \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Variable\</item\> icons on the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Table\</item\> Bar. There are three display modes for tables:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\tablemode.xhp	0	help	par_id3149638	9			0	nb	\<emph\>Fixed\</emph\> - changes only affect the adjacent cell, and not the entire table. For example, when you widen a cell, the adjacent cell becomes narrower, but the width of the table remains constant.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\tablemode.xhp	0	help	par_id3149613	10			0	nb	\<emph\>Fixed, proportional\</emph\> - changes affect the entire table, and wide cells shrink more than narrow cells. For example, when you widen a cell, the adjacent cells become proportionally narrower, but the width of the table remains constant.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\tablemode.xhp	0	help	par_id3149864	11			0	nb	\<emph\>Variable\</emph\> - changes affect the table size. For example, when you widen a cell, the width of the table increases.				20130618 17:22:18
