helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_capital.xhp	0	help	par_idN10728				0	nb	When you apply a formatting to your text by \<emph\>Format - Character\</emph\>, the text stays the same, it is only displayed in another way. On the other hand, when you choose \<emph\>Format - Change Case\</emph\>, the text is permanently changed.				20130618 17:22:18
