helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3154244	37			0	nb	If you insert a manual hyphen in a word, the word is only hyphenated at the manual hyphen. No additional automatic hyphenation is applied for this word. A word with a manual hyphen will be hyphenated without regard to the settings on the \<emph\>Text Flow\</emph\> tab page.				20130618 17:22:18
