helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3149848	40			0	nb	In the Alternatives list, click an entry to copy that related term to the "Replace with" text box.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_thesaurus.xhp	0	help	par_id3153136	45			0	nb	Optionally double-click an entry to look up related terms for that entry. On your keyboard, you can also press the arrow up or down keys to select an entry. Then press Return to replace, or press the spacebar to look up.				20130618 17:22:18
