helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147409	23			0	nb	DocInformation Fields				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	par_id3147487	24			0	nb	For DocInformation fields, the TYPE parameter equals DOCINFO. The SUBTYPE parameter displays the specific field type, for example, for the "Created" DocInformation field, SUBTYPE=CREATE. For date and time DocInformation fields, the FORMAT parameter equals DATE or TIME, and the SDNUM parameter indicates the number format that is used. The SDFIXED parameter indicates if the content of the DocInformation field is fixed or not.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	par_id3147501	25			0	nb	The contents of a fixed date or time field are equal to the SDVAL parameter, otherwise the contents are equal to the text found between the SDFIELD HTML tags.				20130618 17:22:18
