helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120212.xhp	0	help	par_id3145825	10			0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_TOX_SELECT_CB_USE_DASH\"\>Replaces identical index entries that occur on consecutive pages with a single entry and the page range where the entry occurs. For example, the entries "View 10, View 11, View 12" are combined as "View 10-12".\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
