helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_id3145802	2			0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_ATTRIBUTES_CAT\"\>You can choose from various attributes for \<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME\</emph\>            \<emph\>Math\</emph\> formulas. Some attributes are displayed in the lower part of the Elements window.\</ahelp\> These attributes are also listed in the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000001.xhp#kontextmenue\" name=\"context menu\"\>context menu\</link\> of the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window. All attributes not contained in the Elements window or in the context menu must be typed manually in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_id3155962	3			0	nb	The following is a complete list of all attributes available in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Math. The symbol next to the attribute indicates that it can be accessed through the Elements window (choose \<emph\>View - Elements\</emph\>) or through the context menu of the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149604	4			0	nb	I beskrivelsen av egenskapsfunksjonene, som vises nedenfor, er bokstaven «a» i ikonet en plassholder for tegnet du vil tilordne en bestemt egenskap. Du kan bytte ut denne bokstaven med en hvilken som helst bokstav du vil bruke.				20130618 17:22:18
