helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154020	33			0	nb	Select the text file containing the source code and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153198	29			0	nb	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/01050000.xhp\" name=\"Basic IDE\"\>Basic IDE\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
