helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155259	46			0	nb	Initially, the controls receive numbers in the order they are added to the dialog. You can change the order numbers for controls. $[officename] Basic updates the order numbers automatically to avoid duplicate numbers. Controls that cannot be focused are also assigned a value but these controls are skipped when using the Tab key.				20130618 17:22:18
