helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020402.xhp	0	help	par_id3145785	7			0	nb	The drive must be assigned a capital letter. Under Windows, the letter that you assign the drive is restricted by the settings in LASTDRV. If the drive argument is a multiple-character string, only the first letter is relevant. If you attempt to access a non-existent drive, an error occurs that you can respond to with the OnError statement.				20130618 17:22:18
