helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020403.xhp	0	help	par_id3155133	9			0	nb	If no drive is specified or if the drive is a zero-length string (""), CurDir returns the path for the current drive. $[officename] Basic reports an error if the syntax of the drive description is incorrect, the drive does not exist, or if the drive letter occurs after the letter defined in the CONFIG.SYS with the Lastdrive statement.				20130618 17:22:18
