helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030206.xhp	0	help	par_id3153361	2			0	nb	Calculates a serial time value from the specified hour, minute, and second - parameters passed as strings - that represents the time in a single numeric value. This value can be used to calculate the difference between times.				20130618 17:22:18
