helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090301.xhp	0	help	par_id3153190	17			0	nb	If the program encounters a Return statement not preceded by \<emph\>GoSub\</emph\>, $[officename] Basic returns an error message. Use \<emph\>Exit Sub\</emph\> or \<emph\>Exit Function\</emph\> to ensure that the program leaves a Sub or Function before reaching the next Return statement.				20130618 17:22:18
