helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090401.xhp	0	help	par_id3148946	7			0	nb	\<emph\>Parameter:\</emph\> Parameters to pass to the procedure. The type and number of parameters is dependent on the routine that is executing.				20130618 17:22:18
