helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\3d_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN1088B				0	nb	Click the \<emph\>Extrusion On/Off\</emph\> icon\<image id=\"img_id2490920\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_extrusiontoggle.png\" width=\"0.1665inch\" height=\"0.1665inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id2490920\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar, or right-click the object and choose \<emph\>Convert - To 3D\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
