helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152900	2			0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Objects3DToolbox\"\>Opens the \<emph\>3D Objects\</emph\> toolbar. The objects are three dimensional, with depth, illumination, and reflection.\</ahelp\> Each inserted object initially forms a 3D scene. You can press F3 to enter the scene. For these 3D objects, you can open the 3D Effects dialog to edit the properties.				20130618 17:22:18
