helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_idN10731				0	nb	If you select a \<emph\>linear\</emph\> series, the increment that you enter is \<emph\>added\</emph\> to each consecutive number in the series to create the next value.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_idN1073C				0	nb	If you select a \<emph\>growth\</emph\> series, the increment that you enter is \<emph\>multiplied\</emph\> by each consecutive number to create the next value.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\calc_series.xhp	0	help	par_idN10747				0	nb	If you select a \<emph\>date\</emph\> series, the increment that you enter is added to the time unit that you specify.				20130618 17:22:18
