helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreference_dragdrop.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154686	16			0	nb	\<variable id=\"cellreference_dragdrop\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/cellreference_dragdrop.xhp\" name=\"Referencing Cells by Drag-and-Drop\"\>Referere til celler ved å dra og slippe\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreference_dragdrop.xhp	0	help	par_id3156444	17			0	nb	With the help of the Navigator you can reference cells from one sheet to another sheet in the same document or in a different document. The cells can be inserted as a copy, link, or hyperlink. The range to be inserted must be defined with a name in the original file so that it can be inserted in the target file.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreference_dragdrop.xhp	0	help	par_id3152576	25			0	nb	Åpne dokumentet som inneholder kildecellene.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreference_dragdrop.xhp	0	help	par_id3154011	26			0	nb	To set the source range as the range, select the cells and choose \<emph\>Insert - Names - Define\</emph\>. Save the source document, and do not close it.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreference_dragdrop.xhp	0	help	par_id3151073	18			0	nb	Åpne arket der du vil sette inn dataene.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreference_dragdrop.xhp	0	help	par_id3154732	19			0	nb	Åpne \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Navigator\"\>dokumentstrukturen\</link\>. Velg kildefila i boksen nederst i dokumentstrukturen.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreference_dragdrop.xhp	0	help	par_id3150752	22			0	nb	I dokumentstrukturen vises kildeområdet i «Områdenavn».				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreference_dragdrop.xhp	0	help	par_id3154754	27			0	nb	Using the \<emph\>Drag Mode\</emph\> icon in Navigator, choose whether you want the reference to be a hyperlink, link, or copy.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreference_dragdrop.xhp	0	help	par_id3154256	23			0	nb	Trykk på navnet i «Områdenavn» i dokumentstrukturen og dra det inn i cellen der du vil sette inn referansen.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreference_dragdrop.xhp	0	help	par_id3149565	24			0	nb	Denne metoden kan også brukes for å sette inn et område fra et annet ark i samme dokument som det gjeldende arket. Velg det aktive dokumentet som kilde i steg 4 ovenfor.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences.xhp	0	help	tit				0	nb	Referere til en celle i et annet dokument				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147436				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>sheet references\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>references; to cells in other sheets/documents\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>cells; operating in another document\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>documents;references\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147436	9			0	nb	\<variable id=\"cellreferences\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/cellreferences.xhp\" name=\"Referencing Other Sheets\"\>Referere til andre ark\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences.xhp	0	help	par_id9663075				0	nb	I en arkcelle kan du vise referanser til celler i andre ark.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences.xhp	0	help	par_id1879329				0	nb	Du kan også referere til celler i andre dokumenter på samme måte så lenge dokumentet er lagret som en fil fra før.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences.xhp	0	help	hd_id7122409				0	nb	To Reference a Cell in the Same Document				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences.xhp	0	help	par_id2078005				0	nb	Åpne et nytt, tomt regneark.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences.xhp	0	help	par_id4943693				0	nb	Skriv for eksempel inn følgende formel i celle A1 i Ark1:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences.xhp	0	help	par_id9064302				0	nb	               \<item type=\"literal\"\>=Ark2.A1\</item\>            				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences.xhp	0	help	par_id7609790				0	nb	Click the \<emph\>Sheet 2\</emph\> tab at the bottom of the spreadsheet. Set the cursor in cell A1 there and enter text or a number.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences.xhp	0	help	par_id809961				0	nb	If you switch back to Sheet1, you will see the same content in cell A1 there. If the contents of Sheet2.A1 change, then the contents of Sheet1.A1 also change.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences.xhp	0	help	hd_id9209570				0	nb	To Reference a Cell in Another Document				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences.xhp	0	help	par_id5949278				0	nb	Choose \<emph\>File - Open\</emph\>, to load an existing spreadsheet document.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences.xhp	0	help	par_id8001953				0	nb	Choose \<emph\>File - New\</emph\>, to open a new spreadsheet document. Set the cursor in the cell where you want to insert the external data and enter an equals sign to indicate that you want to begin a formula.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences.xhp	0	help	par_id8571123				0	nb	Bytt til dokumentet du lastet. Trykk på cellen med data som du vil sette inn i det nye dokumentet.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences.xhp	0	help	par_id8261665				0	nb	Bytt tilbake til det nye regnearket. I inntastingsfeltet kan du nå se at $[officename] Calc har lagt til referansen i formelen for deg.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences.xhp	0	help	par_id5888241				0	nb	Referanser til celler i andre dokumenter inneholder navnet på det andre dokumentet innesluttet i apostrofer, så en firkant, #, så navnet på arket i det andre dokumentet fulgt av et punktum og navnet på cellen.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences.xhp	0	help	par_id7697683				0	nb	Bekreft formelen ved å trykke på den grønne haken.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences.xhp	0	help	par_id7099826				0	nb	Hvis du drar i håndtaket nederst til høyre i den aktive cellen og velger et celleområde, setter $[officename] automatisk inn tilsvarende referanser i nabocellene. Et resultat av dette er at et dollartegn settes foran arknavnet for å angi det som en absolutt referanse.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences.xhp	0	help	par_id674459				0	nb	Hvis du ser på navnet til det andre dokumentet i formelen, kan du se at det er skrevet som en \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#url\" name=\"URL\"\>adresse (URL)\</link\>. Det betyr at du også kan skrive inn en internettadresse.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences_url.xhp	0	help	tit				0	nb	Referere til andre ark og referere med nettadresser				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences_url.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150441				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>HTML; in sheet cells\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>references; URL in cells\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>cells; Internet references\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>URL; in Calc\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences_url.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150441	15			0	nb	\<variable id=\"cellreferences_url\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/cellreferences_url.xhp\" name=\"Referencing URLs\"\>Referere med nettadresser\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences_url.xhp	0	help	par_id1955626				0	nb	For eksempel hvis du finner en nettside som inneholder børsinformasjon i regnearkceller, kan du laste denne siden inn i $[officename] Calc ved å gjøre følgende:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3152993	39			0	nb	Plasser markøren i en celle der du vil sette inn eksterne data i et $[officename] Calc-dokument.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3145384	40			0	nb	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Link to External Data\</item\>. The \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04090000.xhp\" name=\"External Data\"\>\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>External Data\</item\>\</link\> dialog appears.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3152892	41			0	nb	Enter the URL of the document or Web page in the dialog. The URL must be in the format: http://www.my-bank.com/table.html. The URL for local or local area network files is the path seen in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File - Open\</item\> dialog.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3153068	42			0	nb	$[officename] loads the Web page or file in the "background", that is, without displaying it. In the large list box of the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>External Data\</item\> dialog, you can see the name of all the sheets or named ranges you can choose from.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3153914	43			0	nb	Select one or more sheets or named ranges. You can also activate the automatic update function every "n" seconds and click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3157979	44			0	nb	Innholdet blir satt inn som lenker i $[officename] Calc-dokumentet.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3144768	30			0	nb	Lagre regnearket. Når du åpner det igjen senere, oppdaterer $[officename] Calc cellene med lenker etter en forespørsel.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellreferences_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3159204	38			0	nb	Under \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040900.xhp\" name=\"Spreadsheet - General\"\>\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Calc - General\</item\>\</link\> you can choose to have the update, when opened, automatically carried out either always, upon request or never. The update can be started manually in the dialog under \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Edit - Links\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_by_formula.xhp	0	help	tit				0	nb	Angi format med formler				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_by_formula.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145673				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>formats; assigning by formulas\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>cell formats; assigning by formulas\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>STYLE function example\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>cell styles;assigning by formulas\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>formulas;assigning cell formats\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_by_formula.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145673	13			0	nb	\<variable id=\"cellstyle_by_formula\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/cellstyle_by_formula.xhp\" name=\"Assigning Formats by Formula\"\>Assigning Formats by Formula\</link\> \</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_by_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3150275	14			0	nb	Funksjonen STIL() kan legges til en formel som finnes fra før i en celle. For eksempel sammen med funksjonen GJELDENDE kan du fargelegge en celle avhengig av verdien dens. Formelen «=…+STIL(HVIS(GJELDENDE()>3;"Rød";"Grønn"))» angir cellestilen «Rød» hvis cellens verdi er over 3, eller så angir den cellestilen «Grønn». Du kan lage nye stiler eller finne navn på stiler i \<emph\>stilbehandleren\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_by_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3151385	15			0	nb	If you would like to apply a formula to all cells in a selected area, you can use the\<emph/\>         \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Find & Replace\</item\> dialog.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_by_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3149456	16			0	nb	Merk de ønskede cellene.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_by_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3148797	17			0	nb	Select the menu command \<emph\>Edit - Find & Replace\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_by_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3150767	18			0	nb	For the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Search for\</item\> term, enter: .\<item type=\"literal\"\>*\</item\>            				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_by_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3153770	19			0	nb	«.*» er et regulært uttrykk som angir innholdet i den gjeldende cellen.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_by_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3153143	20			0	nb	Enter the following formula in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Replace with\</item\> field: \<item type=\"literal\"\>=&+STYLE(IF(CURRENT()>3;"Red";"Green"))\</item\>            				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_by_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3146975	21			0	nb	The "&" symbol designates the current contents of the \<emph\>Search for\</emph\> field. The line must begin with an equal sign, since it is a formula. It is assumed that the cell styles "Red" and "Green" already exist.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_by_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3149262	22			0	nb	Mark the fields \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02100000.xhp\" name=\"Regular expressions\"\>\<emph\>Regular expressions\</emph\>\</link\> and \<emph\>Current selection only\</emph\>. Click \<emph\>Find All\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_by_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3144767	24			0	nb	Alle celler med innhold i det valgte området blir nå uthevet.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_by_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3147127	23			0	nb	Click\<emph/\>               \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Replace all\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	tit				0	nb	Bruke vilkårsformatering				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149263				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>conditional formatting; cells\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>cells; conditional formatting\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>formatting; conditional formatting\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>styles;conditional styles\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>cell formats; conditional\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>random numbers;examples\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>cell styles; copying\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>copying; cell styles\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>tables; copying cell styles\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149263	24			0	nb	\<variable id=\"cellstyle_conditional\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/cellstyle_conditional.xhp\" name=\"Applying Conditional Formatting\"\>Bruke vilkårsformatering\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3159156	25			0	nb	Using the menu command \<emph\>Format - Conditional formatting\</emph\>, the dialog allows you to define up to three conditions per cell, which must be met in order for the selected cells to have a particular format.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id8039796				0	nb	To apply conditional formatting, AutoCalculate must be enabled. Choose \<emph\>Tools - Cell Contents - AutoCalculate\</emph\> (you see a check mark next to the command when AutoCalculate is enabled).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3154944	26			0	nb	Med vilkårsformatering kan du for eksempel utheve summer som overstiger gjennomsnittsverdien av alle summene. Hvis totalene endrer seg, endres formateringa tilsvarende uten at du må bytte stil selv.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	hd_id4480727				0	nb	For å lage vilkårene				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3154490	27			0	nb	Velg cellen du vil slå på vilkårsformateringa for.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3155603	28			0	nb	Velg \<emph\>Format → Vilkårsformatering\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3146969	29			0	nb	Skriv inn vilkårene i dialogvinduet. Vinduet beskrives i detalj i \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05120000.xhp\" name=\"$[officename] Help\"\>$[officename] hjelp\</link\>, og et eksempel er gitt nedenfor:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155766	38			0	nb	Example of Conditional Formatting: Highlighting Totals Above/Under the Average Value				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	hd_id4341868				0	nb	Steg 1: Lag nummerverdier				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3150043	39			0	nb	Du vil legge trykk på bestemte verdier i tabellene. For eksempel i en tabell over omsetning kan du vise alle verdier over snittet i grønt og alle under snittet i rødt. Dette er mulig med vilkårsformatering.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3155337	40			0	nb	Fyll først inn en tabell med noen forskjellige verdier. For denne testen kan du lage en tabell med tilfeldige tall:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3149565	41			0	nb	In one of the cells enter the formula =RAND(), and you will obtain a random number between 0 and 1. If you want integers of between 0 and 50, enter the formula =INT(RAND()*50).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3149258	42			0	nb	Kopier formelen for å lage en rad med tilfeldige tall. Dra håndtaket nederst til høyre i cellen mot høyre til du har merket det ønskede celleområdet.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3159236	43			0	nb	På samme måte som beskrevet over, dra håndtaket på cellen lengst til høyre i utvalget nedover for å lage flere rader med tilfeldige tall.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149211	44			0	nb	Steg 2: Still inn cellestiler				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3154659	45			0	nb	Det neste steget er å angi en cellestil til alle verdier som overstiger snittet, og en til de som er under. Sørg for at \<emph\>stilbehandleren\</emph\> er synlig før du fortsetter.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3150883	46			0	nb	Click in a blank cell and select the command \<emph\>Format Cells\</emph\> in the context menu.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3155529	47			0	nb	In the \<emph\>Format Cells\</emph\> dialog on the \<emph\>Background\</emph\> tab, select a background color. Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3154484	48			0	nb	In the Styles and Formatting window, click the \<emph\>New Style from Selection\</emph\> icon. Enter the name of the new style. For this example, name the style "Above".				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3152889	49			0	nb	Trykk igjen på en tom celle og gjør som beskrevet ovenfor, for å lage den andre stilen. Angi en annen bakgrunnsfarge og gi stilen et navn (for eksempel «Under»).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148704	60			0	nb	Steg 3: Beregn gjennomsnitt				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3148837	51			0	nb	I dette eksemplet beregner vi snittet av tilfeldige verdier. Resultatet plasserer vi i en celle:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3144768	52			0	nb	Set the cursor in a blank cell, for example, J14, and choose \<emph\>Insert - Function\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3156016	53			0	nb	Select the AVERAGE function. Use the mouse to select all your random numbers. If you cannot see the entire range, because the Function Wizard is obscuring it, you can temporarily shrink the dialog using the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000001.xhp#eingabesymbol\" name=\"Shrink or Maximize\"\>\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Shrink / Maximize\</item\>\</link\> icon.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cellstyle_conditional.xhp	0	help	par_id3153246	54			0	nb	Close the Function Wizard with \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
