helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN1089F				0	nb	Finn CSV-fila du vil åpne.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN108A2				0	nb	Hvis fila har filetternavnet .csv, velg fila.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN108A5				0	nb	If the CSV file has another extension, select the file, and then select "Text CSV" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File type\</item\> box				20130618 17:22:18
