helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN108BB				0	nb	You can preview the layout of the imported data at the bottom of the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Text Import\</item\> dialog. 				20130618 17:22:18
