helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\csv_formula.xhp	0	help	par_id3146781	12			0	nb	If the numbers use commas as decimal separators or thousands separators, do not select the comma as the field delimiter. If the text contains double quotation marks, you must select the single quotation mark as separator.				20130618 17:22:18
