helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_deletetable.xhp	0	help	par_id3154014	32			0	nb	In order to delete a pivot table, click any cell in the pivot table, then choose \<emph\>Delete\</emph\> in the context menu.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_edittable.xhp	0	help	tit				0	nb	Editing Pivot Tables				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_edittable.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148663				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>pivot table function; editing tables\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>editing;pivot tables\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_edittable.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148663	25			0	nb	\<variable id=\"datapilot_edittable\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/datapilot_edittable.xhp\" name=\"Editing Pivot Tables\"\>Editing Pivot Tables\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_edittable.xhp	0	help	par_id3150868	26			0	nb	Click one of the buttons in the pivot table and hold the mouse button down. A special symbol will appear next to the mouse pointer.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_edittable.xhp	0	help	par_id3145786	27			0	nb	Ved å dra knappen til et annet sted i den samme raden kan du endre rekkefølgen på kolonnene. Hvis du drar en knapp til den venstre kanten av tabellen inn i radoverskriftsområdet, kan du endre en kolonne til en rad.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_edittable.xhp	0	help	par_id1648915				0	nb	In the Pivot Table dialog, you can drag a button to the \<emph\>Page Fields\</emph\> area to create a button and a listbox on top of the pivot table. The listbox can be used to filter the pivot table by the contents of the selected item. You can use drag-and-drop within the pivot table to use another page field as a filter.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_edittable.xhp	0	help	par_id3147434	29			0	nb	To remove a button from the table, just drag it out of the pivot table. Release the mouse button when the mouse pointer positioned within the sheet has become a 'not allowed' icon. The button is deleted.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_edittable.xhp	0	help	par_id3156442	40			0	nb	To edit the pivot table, click a cell inside the pivot table and open the context menu. In the context menu you find the command \<emph\>Edit Layout\</emph\>, which displays the \<emph\>Pivot Table\</emph\> dialog for the current pivot table.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_edittable.xhp	0	help	par_id2666096				0	nb	In the pivot table, you can use drag-and-drop or cut/paste commands to rearrange the order of data fields.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_edittable.xhp	0	help	par_id266609688				0	nb	You can assign custom display names to fields, field members, subtotals (with some restrictions), and grand totals inside pivot tables. A custom display name is assigned to an item by overwriting the original name with another name.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_filtertable.xhp	0	help	tit				0	nb	Filtering Pivot Tables				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_filtertable.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150792				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>pivot table function; filtering tables\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>filtering;pivot tables\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_filtertable.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150792				0	nb	\<variable id=\"datapilot_filtertable\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/datapilot_filtertable.xhp\" name=\"Filtering Pivot Tables\"\>Filtering Pivot Tables\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_filtertable.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	nb	You can use filters to remove unwanted data from a pivot table.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_filtertable.xhp	0	help	par_id3150441				0	nb	Click the \<emph\>Filter\</emph\> button in the sheet to call up the dialog for the filter conditions. Alternatively, call up the context menu of the pivot table and select the \<emph\>Filter\</emph\> command. The \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12090103.xhp\" name=\"Filter\"\>\<emph\>Filter\</emph\>\</link\> dialog appears. Here you can filter the pivot table.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_filtertable.xhp	0	help	par_id315044199				0	nb	You can also click the arrow on a button in the pivot table to show a pop-up window. In this pop-up window, you can edit the visibility settings of the associated field.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_filtertable.xhp	0	help	par_id0720201001344485				0	nb	The pop-up window displays a list of field members associated with that field. A check box is placed to the left of each field member name. When a field has an alternative display name that differs from its original name, that name is displayed in the list.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_filtertable.xhp	0	help	par_id0720201001344449				0	nb	Enable or disable a checkbox to show or hide the associated field member in the pivot table.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_filtertable.xhp	0	help	par_id0720201001344493				0	nb	Enable or disable the \<emph\>All\</emph\> checkbox to show all or none of the field members.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_filtertable.xhp	0	help	par_id0720201001344431				0	nb	Select a field member in the pop-up window and click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Show only the current item\</item\> button to show only the selected field member. All other field members are hidden in the pivot table.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_filtertable.xhp	0	help	par_id0720201001344484				0	nb	Select a field member in the pop-up window and click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Hide only the current item\</item\> button to hide only the selected field member. All other field members are shown in the pivot table.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_filtertable.xhp	0	help	par_id0720201001344578				0	nb	Commands enable you to sort the field members in ascending order, descending order, or using a custom sort list.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_filtertable.xhp	0	help	par_id0720201001344584				0	nb	To edit the custom sort lists, open \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Calc - Sort Lists.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_filtertable.xhp	0	help	par_id0720201001344811				0	nb	The arrow to open the pop-up window is normally black. When the field contains one or more hidden field members, the arrow is blue and displays a tiny square at its lower-right corner.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_filtertable.xhp	0	help	par_id0720201001344884				0	nb	You can also open the pop-up window by positioning the cell cursor at the button and pressing \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+D.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_grouping.xhp	0	help	tit				0	nb	Grouping Pivot Tables				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_grouping.xhp	0	help	bm_id4195684				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>grouping; pivot tables\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>pivot table function;grouping table entries\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>ungrouping entries in pivot tables\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_grouping.xhp	0	help	par_idN10643				0	nb	\<variable id=\"datapilot_grouping\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/datapilot_grouping.xhp\"\>Grouping Pivot Tables\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_grouping.xhp	0	help	par_idN10661				0	nb	The resulting pivot table can contain many different entries. By grouping the entries, you can improve the visible result.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_grouping.xhp	0	help	par_idN10667				0	nb	Select a cell or range of cells in the pivot table.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_grouping.xhp	0	help	par_idN1066B				0	nb	Velg \<emph\>Data → Grupper og disponer → Grupper\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_grouping.xhp	0	help	par_idN1066E				0	nb	Depending on the format of the selected cells, either a new group field is added to the pivot table, or you see one of the two \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12090400.xhp\"\>Grouping\</link\> dialogs, either for numeric values, or for date values.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_grouping.xhp	0	help	par_id3328653				0	nb	The pivot table must be organized in a way that grouping can be applied.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_grouping.xhp	0	help	par_idN10682				0	nb	Trykk innen en gruppe og velg \<emph\>Data → Grupper og disponer → Løs opp gruppe\</emph\> for å fjerne en gruppe.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_tipps.xhp	0	help	tit				0	nb	Selecting Pivot Table Output Ranges				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_tipps.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148663				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>pivot table function; preventing data overwriting\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>output ranges of pivot tables\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_tipps.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148663	19			0	nb	\<variable id=\"datapilot_tipps\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/datapilot_tipps.xhp\" name=\"Selecting Pivot Table Output Ranges\"\>Selecting Pivot Table Output Ranges\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_tipps.xhp	0	help	par_id3154123	20			0	nb	Click the button \<emph\>More\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Pivot Table\</emph\> dialog. The dialog will be extended.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_tipps.xhp	0	help	par_id3153771	21			0	nb	You can select a named range in which the pivot table is to be created, from the \<emph\>Results to\</emph\> box. If the results range does not have a name, enter the coordinates of the upper left cell of the range into the field to the right of the \<emph\>Results to\</emph\> box. You can also click on the appropriate cell to have the coordinates entered accordingly.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_tipps.xhp	0	help	par_id3146974	23			0	nb	If you mark the \<emph\>Ignore empty rows\</emph\> check box, they will not be taken into account when the pivot table is created.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_tipps.xhp	0	help	par_id3145273	24			0	nb	If the \<emph\>Identify categories\</emph\> check box is marked, the categories will be identified by their headings and assigned accordingly when the pivot table is created.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_updatetable.xhp	0	help	tit				0	nb	Updating Pivot Tables				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_updatetable.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150792				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>pivot table import\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>pivot table function; refreshing tables\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>recalculating;pivot tables\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>updating;pivot tables\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_updatetable.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150792	33			0	nb	\<variable id=\"datapilot_updatetable\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/datapilot_updatetable.xhp\" name=\"Updating Pivot Tables\"\>Updating Pivot Tables\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_updatetable.xhp	0	help	par_id3154684	34			0	nb	If the data of the source sheet has been changed, $[officename] recalculates the pivot table. To recalculate the table, choose \<emph\>Data - Pivot Table - Refresh\</emph\>. Do the same after you have imported an Excel pivot table into $[officename] Calc.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	tit				0	nb	Importere og eksportere dBASE-filer				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	bm_id1226844				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>exporting;spreadsheets to dBASE\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>importing;dBASE files\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>dBASE import/export\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>spreadsheets; importing from/exporting to dBASE files\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>tables in databases;importing dBASE files\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10738				0	nb	\<variable id=\"dbase_files\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/dbase_files.xhp\"\>Importere og eksportere dBASE-filer\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10756				0	nb	Du kan åpne og lagre data i dBASE-formatet (filetternavnet .dbf) i $[officename] Base eller et regneark. I %PRODUCTNAME Base er en dBASE-database en mappe som inneholder filer med filetternavnet .dbf. Hver fil tilsvarer en tabell i databasen. Formler og formatering går tapt når du åpner og lagrer dBASE-filer i %PRODUCTNAME.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10759				0	nb	Importere en dBASE-fil inn i et regneark				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10760				0	nb	Velg \<emph\>Fil → Åpne\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN1071F				0	nb	Finn dBASE-fila du vil importere. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10768				0	nb	Trykk på \<emph\>Åpne\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10730				0	nb	Dialogvinduet \<emph\>Importer dBASE-filer\</emph\> åpnes.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10774				0	nb	Trykk på \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10777				0	nb	dBASE-fila åpnes som et nytt Calc-regneark.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN1074E				0	nb	Hvis du vil lagre regnearket som en dBASE-fil, må du ikke endre eller slette den første raden i den importerte fila. Denne raden inneholder informasjon som kreves av en dBASE-database.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN1077A				0	nb	Importere en dBASE-fil inn i en databasetabell				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN1076C				0	nb	En %PRODUCTNAME Base-databasetabell er egentlig en lenke til en database.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10796				0	nb	Velg \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Fil → Ny → Database\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10786				0	nb	Skriv inn et databasenavn i feltet \<emph\>Filnavn\</emph\> i dialogvinduet \<emph\>Lagre som\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10792				0	nb	Click \<emph\>Save\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN1079A				0	nb	Velg «dBASE» i boksen \<emph\>Databasetype\</emph\> i dialogvinduet \<emph\>Databaseegenskaper\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A6				0	nb	Trykk på \<emph\>Neste\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN107AE				0	nb	Trykk på \<emph\>Bla gjennom\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B6				0	nb	Finn mappa som inneholder dBASE-filene, og trykk på \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN107BE				0	nb	Velg \<emph\>Fullfør\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN107F1				0	nb	To Save a Spreadsheet as a dBASE File				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN107F8				0	nb	Choose \<emph\>File - Save As\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10800				0	nb	Velg «dBASE-file» i boksen \<emph\>Filformat\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN107F9				0	nb	Skriv inn navnet på dBASE-fila i feltet \<emph\>Filnavn\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10801				0	nb	Click \<emph\>Save\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\dbase_files.xhp	0	help	par_idN10808				0	nb	Bare dataene i det valgte arket blir eksportert.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\design.xhp	0	help	tit				0	nb	Velge temaer for ark				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\design.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150791				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>temavalg for ark\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>utforming;regneark\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>cellestiler;velge\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>velge;formateringstemaer\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>regneark;formateringstemaer\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>formater;temaer for ark\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>formatering;temaer for ark\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\design.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150791	6			0	nb	\<variable id=\"design\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/design.xhp\" name=\"Selecting Themes for Sheets\"\>Velge temaer for ark\</link\> \</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\design.xhp	0	help	par_id3145786	13			0	nb	$[officename] Calc har et sett med standardtemaer for formatering som du kan bruke i dine regneark.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\design.xhp	0	help	par_id3154490	16			0	nb	Det er ikke mulig å legge til temaer i Calc, og de kan ikke endres. Men du kan endre stilene etter at du har tatt dem i bruk i et regneark.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\design.xhp	0	help	par_id3154757	17			0	nb	Før du formaterer et ark med et tema må du slå på minst en selvvalgt cellestil for cellene i regnearket. Så kan du endre celleformatet ved å velge et tema i dialogvinduet \<emph\>Temavalg\</emph\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\design.xhp	0	help	par_id3156382	18			0	nb	Åpne \<emph\>stilbehandleren\</emph\> og velg «Selvvalgte stiler» i den nederste boksen for å velge en selvvalgt stil for en celle. Det vises nå en liste over selvvalgte stiler som allerede finnes. Dobbeltklikk på et navn i stilbehandleren for å bruke den stilen i de valgte cellene.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\design.xhp	0	help	par_id3153963	19			0	nb	Bruke et tema i et regneark:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\design.xhp	0	help	par_id3146920	15			0	nb	Trykk på knappen \<emph\>Velg temaer\</emph\> i verktøylinja \<emph\>Verktøy\</emph\>. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\design.xhp	0	help	par_id3148488	20			0	nb	Dialogvinduet \<emph\>Temavalg\</emph\> åpnes. Vinduet viser en liste over tilgjengelige stiler for arket i sin helhet og stilbehandleren viser de selvvalgte stilene for bestemte celler.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\design.xhp	0	help	par_id3155114	9			0	nb	Velg temaet du vil bruke for regnearket i \<emph\>Temavalg\</emph\>-vinduet.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\design.xhp	0	help	par_id3150090	21			0	nb	Velg \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\design.xhp	0	help	par_id3150201	22			0	nb	Så snart du velger et annet tema i \<emph\>Temavalg\</emph\>-vinduet blir noen av egenskapene til den selvvalgte stilen tatt i bruk i det gjeldende regnearket. Endringene er synlige i regnearket med en gang.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\design.xhp	0	help	par_id3146979	12			0	nb	\<link href=\"text/scalc/02/06080000.xhp\" name=\"Theme selection\"\>Temavalg\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\edit_multitables.xhp	0	help	tit				0	nb	Kopiere til flere ark				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\edit_multitables.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149456				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>kopiere;verdier til flere ark\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>lime inn;verdier i flere ark\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>data;sette inn i flere ark\</bookmark_value\> \<bookmark_value\>ark;fylle flere samtidig\</bookmark_value\> 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\edit_multitables.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149456	3			0	nb	\<variable id=\"edit_multitables\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/edit_multitables.xhp\" name=\"Copying to Multiple Sheets\"\>Kopiere til flere ark\</link\> \</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\edit_multitables.xhp	0	help	par_id3150868	6			0	nb	I $[officename] Calc kan du sette inn verdier, tekst eller formler som samtidig blir kopiert til andre valgte ark i dokumentet.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\edit_multitables.xhp	0	help	par_id3153768	8			0	nb	Velg alle ønskede ark ved å holde nede \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Kommando\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>-tasten og trykke på de arkenes faner som fortsatt er gråe, i bunnen av arbeidsområdet. Alle valgte ark har nå hvite faner.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\edit_multitables.xhp	0	help	par_idN10614				0	nb	You can use Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Page Up or Page Down to select multiple sheets using the keyboard.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\edit_multitables.xhp	0	help	par_id3147435	7			0	nb	Når du nå setter inn verdier, tekst eller formler i det synlige arket, vil de også dukke opp på samme plass i de andre valgte arkene. For eksempel om du skriver inn data i celle A1 i det synlige arket, blir dataene også satt inn i celle A1 i alle andre valgte ark.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\filters.xhp	0	help	tit				0	nb	Bruke filtre				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\filters.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153896				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>filters; applying/removing\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>rows;removing/redisplaying with filters\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>removing;filters\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\filters.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153896	70			0	nb	\<variable id=\"filters\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/filters.xhp\" name=\"Applying Filters\"\>Bruke filtre\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\filters.xhp	0	help	par_id3150869	2			0	nb	Filtre og avanserte filtre lar deg arbeide med bestemte filtrerte rader (poster) i et dataområde. I regneark i $[officename] finnes det flere måter å bruke filtre.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\filters.xhp	0	help	par_id3155131	3			0	nb	Ett bruksområde for \<emph\>autofiltrering\</emph\> er å raskt begrense visningen av poster med like data i et datafelt.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\filters.xhp	0	help	par_id3146119	4			0	nb	In the \<emph\>Standard Filter\</emph\> dialog, you can also define ranges which contain the values in particular data fields. You can use the standard filter to connect the conditions with either a logical AND or a logical OR operator.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\filters.xhp	0	help	par_id3150010	5			0	nb	The \<emph\>Advanced filter\</emph\> allows up to a total of eight filter conditions. With advanced filters you enter the conditions directly into the sheet.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\filters.xhp	0	help	par_id9384746				0	nb	Hvis du skal fjerne et filter, så du kan se alle cellene igjen, trykker du i området som er filtrert, og velger \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Data → Filter → Fjern filter\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\filters.xhp	0	help	par_idN10663				0	nb	Når du velger flere rader i et filtrert område, kan utvalget inneholde synlige rader og rader som skjules av filteret. Hvis du angir formatering eller sletter de valgte radene, skjer dette kun med de synlige radene. De skjulte radene blir ikke påvirket. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\filters.xhp	0	help	par_id218817				0	nb	Dette er motsatt av det som skjer med rader du har skjult med \<emph\>Format → Rader →Skjul rader\</emph\>. Vanlige skjulte rader blir slettet når du sletter et utvalg som inneholder dem.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	tit				0	nb	Søke og erstatte i Calc				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	bm_id3769341				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>søke, se også finne\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>finne;formler/verdier/tekst/objekter\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>erstatte;celleinnhold\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>formatere;flere celletekster\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149204				0	nb	\<variable id=\"finding\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/finding.xhp\"\>Søke og erstatte i Calc\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id9363689				0	nb	I regnearkdokumenter kan du finne ord, formler og stiler. Du kan flytte fra et resultat til det neste, eller du kan utheve alle samsvarende celler med en gang, og så velge et annet format eller erstatte celleinnholdet med annet innhold.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	hd_id3610644				0	nb	Dialogvinduet søk og erstatt				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id2224494				0	nb	Celler kan inneholde tekst eller tall som ble skrevet rett inn som i et tekstdokument. Men celler kan også inneholde tekst eller tall som er resultatet av beregninger. For eksempel hvis en celle inneholder formelen «=1+2» viser den resultatet «3». Du må velge om du vil søke etter 1 eller 2, eller resultatet 3.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	hd_id2423780				0	nb	Finne formler eller verdier				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id2569658				0	nb	I vinduet «Søk og erstatt» kan du velge om du skal søke i formler eller i resultatet av beregningene.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id6394238				0	nb	Velg \<emph\>Rediger → Søk og erstatt\</emph\> for å åpne dialogvinduet «Søk og erstatt».				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id7214270				0	nb	Trykk på \<emph\>Flere valg\</emph\> for å utvide dialogvinduet.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id2186346				0	nb	Velg «Formler» eller «Verdier» i lista \<emph\>Søk i\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id1331217				0	nb	Med «Formler» finner du alle deler av formlene. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id393993				0	nb	Med «Verdier» finner du resultatet av beregningene. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id3163853				0	nb	Celleinnholdet kan formateres på flere måter. For eksempel kan et tall formateres som valuta for å vise det med et valutasymbol. Du får se valutasymbolet i cellen, men du kan ikke søke etter det.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	hd_id7359233				0	nb	Søke etter tekst				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id6549272				0	nb	Velg \<emph\>Rediger → Søk og erstatt\</emph\> for å åpne dialogvinduet «Søk og erstatt».				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id6529740				0	nb	Skriv inn søketeksten i tekstfeltet \<emph\>Søk etter\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id9121982				0	nb	Trykk enten på \<emph\>Søk\</emph\> eller \<emph\>Søk etter alle\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id3808404				0	nb	Når du trykker på \<emph\>Søk\</emph\>, velger Calc den neste cellen som inneholder søketeksten. Du kan endre søketeksten om du vil og trykke på \<emph\>Søk\</emph\> igjen for å gå til den neste cellen som ble funnet. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id2394482				0	nb	Hvis du lukket vinduet, kan du trykke på \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Kommando\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> + Shift + F for å finne neste celle uten å åpne dialogvinduet. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id631733				0	nb	Som standard søker Calc i det valgte arket. Trykk på \<emph\>Flere valg\</emph\> og slå på \<emph\>Søk i alle arkene\</emph\> for å søke gjennom alle arkene i dokumentet.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id7811822				0	nb	Når du trykker på \<emph\>Søk etter alle\</emph\>, velger Calc alle cellene som inneholder søketeksten. Nå kan du blant annet sette teksten i alle cellene som ble funnet, til halvfet eller angi en cellestil til alle samtidig.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	hd_id8531449				0	nb	Dokumentstrukturen				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id9183935				0	nb	Velg \<emph\>Vis → Dokumentstruktur\</emph\> for å vise dokumentstrukturen.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id946684				0	nb	Dokumentstrukturen er det viktigste verktøyet når du skal finne og merke objekter.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id9607226				0	nb	Bruk dokumentstrukturen for å sette inn objekter og lenker innen dokumentet eller fra andre åpne dokumenter.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_table.xhp	0	help	tit				0	nb	Formatere regneark				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_table.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154125				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>tekst i celler; formatere\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>regneark;formatere\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>bakgrunner;celler og sider\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>kantlinjer;celler og sider\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>formatere;regneark\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>tall;formateringsinnstillinger for valgte celler\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>celler;tallformater\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>valutaer;formater\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_table.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154125	6			0	nb	\<variable id=\"format_table\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/format_table.xhp\" name=\"Designing Spreadsheets\"\>Formatere regneark\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_table.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153912	13			0	nb	Formatere tekst i et regneark 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3144772	14			0	nb	Velg teksten du vil formatere.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3155268	15			0	nb	Velg de ønskede tekstegenskapene i \<emph\>Formateringslinja\</emph\>. Du kan også velge \<emph\>Format → Celler\</emph\>. Dialogvinduet \<emph\>Celleegenskaper\</emph\> vises hvor du kan velge forskjellige tekstegenskaper på fanen \<emph\>Skrift\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_table.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149899	16			0	nb	Formatere tall i et regneark				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3159226	17			0	nb	Velg cellene som inneholder tallene du vil formatere.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3150046	18			0	nb	Trykk på knappene på \<emph\>Formateringslinja\</emph\> for å formatere tall som standardvaluta eller som prosent. For andre formater velger du \<emph\>Format → Celler\</emph\>. Du kan velge forhåndsvalgte formater eller angi dine egne på fanen \<emph\>Tall\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_table.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153483	19			0	nb	Formatere kantlinjer og bakgrunner for celler og sider				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3154733	20			0	nb	Du kan velge et format for en gruppe celler ved først å velge cellene (for flervalg holder du nede \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Kommando\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>-tasten når du trykker), og så åpne \<emph\>Celleegenskaper\</emph\> med \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format → Celler\</item\>. I vinduet kan du velge egenskaper som skygger og bakgrunner.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3145116	21			0	nb	Velg \<emph\>Format → Side\</emph\> for å velge formateringsegenskaper for hele arket. Du kan angi topp- og bunntekstene som skal vises på hver side som skrives ut.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_table.xhp	0	help	par_id3145389	22			0	nb	Et bilde du har lastet med \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format → Side → Bakgrunn\</item\> er bare synlig i utskrifter eller sidens forhåndsvisning. Hvis du vil vise bakgrunnsbildet på skjermen også, sett inn bildet ved å velge \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Sett inn → Bilde → Fra fil\</item\> og plasser bildet i bakgrunnen med \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format → Still opp → Til bakgrunn\</item\>. Bruk \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Navigator\"\>Dokumentstrukturen\</link\> til å velge bakgrunnsbildet.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_table.xhp	0	help	par_id2837916				0	nb	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020300.xhp\"\>Formateringsvalg for tall\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_table.xhp	0	help	par_id2614215				0	nb	\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/background.xhp\"\>Cellebakgrunner\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value.xhp	0	help	tit				0	nb	Formatere tall med desimaler				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145367				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>numbers;formatting decimals\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>formats; numbers in tables\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>tables; number formats\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>defaults; number formats in spreadsheets\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>decimal places;formatting numbers\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>formatting;numbers with decimals\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>formatting;adding/deleting decimal places\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>number formats; adding/deleting decimal places in cells\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>deleting; decimal places\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>decimal places; adding/deleting\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145367	4			0	nb	\<variable id=\"format_value\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/format_value.xhp\" name=\"Formatting Numbers With Decimals\"\>Formatere tall med desimaler\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value.xhp	0	help	par_id3148576	5			0	nb	Skriv inn et tall i et ark, for eksempel 1234,5678. Dette tallet blir vist i standardformatet for tall med to desimaler. Altså vises 1234,57 når du bekrefter inntastingen. Bare visningen i dokumentet er avrundet; internt beholder tallet alle sine fire desimaler.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value.xhp	0	help	par_id3154012	12			0	nb	Formatere tall med desimaler:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value.xhp	0	help	par_id3147394	6			0	nb	Merk tallet og velg \<emph\>Format → Celler\</emph\> for å åpne vinduet \<emph\>Celleegenskaper\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value.xhp	0	help	par_id3153157	9			0	nb	På fanen \<emph\>Tall\</emph\> vises en liste med forhåndsvalgte tallformater. Nederst til høyre i vinduet er det en forhåndsvisning av hvordan det valgte tallet vil se ut hvis du velger et bestemt format.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value.xhp	0	help	par_id3155766				0	nb	\<image id=\"img_id3149021\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_numberformatincdecimals.png\" width=\"0.222in\" height=\"0.222in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149021\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value.xhp	0	help	par_id3149256	10			0	nb	Hvis du bare vil endre antallet desimaler som vises, er den enkleste måten å bruke knappene \<emph\>Tallformat: Legg til tall bak komma\</emph\> eller \<emph\>Tallformat: Fjern tall bak komma\</emph\> på formateringslinja.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	tit				0	nb	Selvvalgte tallformater				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	bm_id3143268				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>numbers;user-defined formatting\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>formatting; user-defined numbers\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>number formats; millions\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>format codes; user-defined number formats\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143268	26			0	nb	\<variable id=\"format_value_userdef\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/format_value_userdef.xhp\" name=\"User-defined Number Formats\"\>User-defined Number Formats\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3150400	1			0	nb	Du kan angi dine egne tallformater for visning av tall i \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Calc.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3150767	2			0	nb	For eksempel hvis du vil vise tallet 10 200 000 som 10,2 mill. gjør du følgende:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3150868	3			0	nb	Velg cellene du vil angi et nytt, selvvalgt format for.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3149664	4			0	nb	Velg \<emph\>Format → Celler → Tall\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3149260	5			0	nb	Velg «Selvvalgt» i lista \<emph\>Kategorier\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3148646	6			0	nb	Skriv inn koden nedenfor i feltet \<emph\>Formatkode\</emph\>. Merk at det norske tusenskille er mellomrom, og at to tusenskiller følger den siste nullen. Det betyr også at om man vil sette inn mellomrom i formatkoder, må de omsluttes av falske doble hermetegn.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3152596	7			0	nb	0,0  " mill."				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3144764	8			0	nb	Velg \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3155417	9			0	nb	Den følgende tabellen viser effekten av avrunding, tusenskiller ( ), desimaltegn (,) og plassholderne # og 0.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3146971	10			0	nb	Tall				20130618 17:22:18
