helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\integer_leading_zero.xhp	0	help	par_id3155068	62			0	nb	In the \<emph\>Replace with\</emph\> box, enter \<item type=\"input\"\>&\</item\>               				20130618 17:22:18
