helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3159240	3			0	nb	Sett dokumentet i fokus med \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Kommando\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> + F6.				20130618 17:22:18
