helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	par_id3153728	2			0	nb	Når du skriver ut regneark kan du velge hva som skal skrives ut:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	par_id3150010	3			0	nb	Rad- og kolonneoverskrifter				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	par_id3154013	4			0	nb	Arkrutenett				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_details.xhp	0	help	par_id3145273	5			0	nb	Comments				20130618 17:22:18
