helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rounding_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3150045	12			0	nb	Choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Calc\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
