helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_view.xhp	0	help	par_id3153768	3			0	nb	Under the menu item \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Calc,\</emph\> go to the \<emph\>View\</emph\> tab page. Unmark\<emph\> Column/row headers\</emph\>. Confirm with \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
