helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148925	128			0	nb	For å finne den korteste avstanden til skolen for barna i hver klasse i det forrige eksemplet (rull oppover), skriv inn følgende formel i B16:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149161	129			0	nb	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DMIN(A1:E10;"Distance to School";A13:E14)\</item\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148917	130			0	nb	I rad 14, under klasse, skriv inn \<item type=\"input\"\>1, 2, 3\</item\> og så videre, en etter en. Den korteste avstanden til skolen for hver klasse vil vises.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154274				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>DAVERAGE function\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>averages; in Calc databases\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>calculating;averages in Calc databases\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
