helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152840	316			0	nb	\<emph\>Base\</emph\> (optional) is the base for the logarithm calculation. If omitted, Base 10 is assumed.				20130618 17:22:18
