helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3163596				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>SUM function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>adding;numbers in cell ranges\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3163596	428			0	nb	SUMMER				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3163625	429			0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_SUMME\"\>Legg sammen alle tallene i et celleområde.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3163643	430			0	nb	Syntaks				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3163656	431			0	nb	SUMMER(Tall1; Tall2; ...; Tall30)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3163671	432			0	nb	\<emph\>Number 1 to Number 30\</emph\> are up to 30 arguments whose sum is to be calculated.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3163690	433			0	nb	Eksempel				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3163704	434			0	nb	Hvis du skriver inn tallene \<item type=\"input\"\>2\</item\>, \<item type=\"input\"\>3\</item\> og \<item type=\"input\"\>4\</item\> i tekstfeltene Tall1, Tall2 og Tall3, vil resultatet 9 bli returnert.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151740	556			0	nb	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SUM(A1;A3;B5)\</item\> calculates the sum of the three cells. \<item type=\"input\"\>=SUM (A1:E10)\</item\> calculates the sum of all cells in the A1 to E10 cell range.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151756	619			0	nb	Betingelser lenket sammen med OG kan brukes med funksjonen SUM() på følgende måte:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151774	620			0	nb	Eksempel: Du har skrevet inn fakturaer i en tabell. Kolonne A inneholder datoverdien av fakturaen, kolonne B inneholder beløpet. Du vil finne et skjema, som du skal bruke for å beregne totalbeløpet for en spesifikk måned, for eksempel summen av fakturaer i perioden >=2008-01-01 til <2008-02-01. Området med datoværdierne dækker A1:A40. Området, som indeholder fakturabeløp, som skal opsummeres, er i B1:B40. C1 inneholder startdatoen, 2008\<item type=\"input\"\>-01-01\</item\>, hvor fakturaer skal være inkludert, og C2 datoen, 2008\<item type=\"input\"\>-02-01\</item\>, som ikke lengre skal inkluderes.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151799	621			0	nb	Skriv inn den følgende formelen som en matriseformel:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151813	622			0	nb	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SUM((A1:A40>=C1)*(A1:A40<C2)*B1:B40)\</item\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151828	623			0	nb	For å skrive inn dette som en matriseformel, kan du trykke «Shift\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>+Kommando\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>+ Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter» i stedet for å bare trykke «Enter» for å lukke formelen. Formelen vil så bli vist i \<emph\>Formellinjen\</emph\> omgitt av klammeparenteser.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151869	624			0	nb	{=SUMMER((A1:A40>=C1)*(A1:A40<C2)*B1:B40)}				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151884	625			0	nb	The formula is based on the fact that the result of a comparison is 1 if the criterion is met and 0 if it is not met. The individual comparison results will be treated as an array and used in matrix multiplication, and at the end the individual values will be totaled to give the result matrix.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151957				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>SUMIF function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>adding;specified numbers\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151957	436			0	nb	SUMMER.HVIS (SUMIF på engelsk)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151986	437			0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_SUMMEWENN\"\>Legg til cellene som er angitt av et visst kriterium.\</ahelp\> Du kan bruke denne funksjonen til å bla igjennom et dataområde når du søker etter en bestemt verdi.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152015	438			0	nb	Syntaks				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152028	439			0	nb	SUMMER.HVIS(Område; Kriterier; SumOmråde)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152043	440			0	nb	\<emph\>Range\</emph\> is the range to which the criteria are to be applied.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152062	441			0	nb	\<emph\>Criteria\</emph\> is the cell in which the search criterion is shown, or the search criterion itself. If the criteria is written into the formula, it has to be surrounded by double quotes.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152083	442			0	nb	\<emph\>SumRange\</emph\> is the range from which values are summed. If this parameter has not been indicated, the values found in the Range are summed.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id8347422				0	nb	SUMMER.HVIS operatøren for referansesammentrekning (~) i parameteren Kriterier, og bare hvis den valgfrie parameteren SummerOmråde ikke er gitt.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152110	443			0	nb	Eksempel				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152148	626			0	nb	To sum up only negative numbers: \<item type=\"input\"\>=SUMIF(A1:A10;"<0")\</item\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id6670125				0	nb	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SUMIF(A1:A10;">0";B1:10)\</item\> - sums values from the range B1:B10 only if the corresponding values in the range A1:A10 are >0.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id6062196				0	nb	Se TELL.HVIS() for flere eksempler på syntaks som kan brukes med SUMMER.HVIS().				20130618 17:22:18
