helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3068636				0	nb	En alternativ implementering ville vært \<item type=\"literal\"\>Multiplum * AVRUND(Verdi/Multiplum)\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3164333	662			0	nb	Eksempel				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164347	663			0	nb	\<item type=\"input\"\>=MROUND(15.5;3)\</item\> returns 15, as 15.5 is closer to 15 (= 3*5) than to 18 (= 3*6).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_idN14DD6				0	nb	\<item type=\"input\"\>=MROUND(1.4;0.5)\</item\> returns 1.5 (= 0.5*3).				20130618 17:22:18
