helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3164745	673			0	nb	Syntaks				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164758	674			0	nb	TILFELDIGMELLOM (Bunn; Topp)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id7112338				0	nb	Gir et tilfeldig heltall mellom heltallene \<emph\>Bunn\</emph\> og \<emph\>Topp\</emph\> (begge inklusive).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id2855616				0	nb	Denne funksjonen produserer ett nytt tilfeldig tall, hver gang Calc omberegner. For å manuelt tvinge Calc til å omberegne, trykke på «Skift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Æble\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F9».				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id2091433				0	nb	For å lage tilfeldige tall som aldri omberegnes, kopier cellene som inneholder denne funksjonen, og bruk \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Rediger → Sett inn Spesiell\</item\> (med \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Sett inn alt\</item\> og ikke \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Formler\</item\> merket og \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tall\</item\> merket).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3164772	675			0	nb	Eksempel				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164785	676			0	nb	\<item type=\"input\"\>=RANDBETWEEN(20;30)\</item\> returns an integer of between 20 and 30.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3164800				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>RAND function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>random numbers;between 0 and 1\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
