helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148829				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>antall ark; funksjon\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>ANTALL.ARK-funksjon\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
