helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146952	113			0	nb	Syntaks				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3159194	114			0	nb	FORSKYVNING(Referanse; Rader; Kolonner; Høyde; Bredde)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3152360	115			0	nb	\<emph\>Referanse\</emph\> er cellen hvorfra funksjonen leter etter den nye referansen.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3156032	116			0	nb	\<emph\>Rader\</emph\> er antall rader referansen ble korrigert oppover (negativ verdi) eller ned.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3166458	117			0	nb	\<emph\>Kolonner\</emph\> (valgfri) er antall kolonner referansen ble korrigert til venstre (negativ verdi) eller til høyre.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3150708	118			0	nb	\<emph\>Høyde\</emph\> (valgfri) er den valgfrie loddrette høyden på et område som begynner ved den nye referanseposisjonen.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3147278	119			0	nb	\<emph\>Bredde\</emph\> (valgfri) er den vannrette bredden for et område som begynner ved den nye referanseposisjonen.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id8662373				0	nb	Arguments \<emph\>Rows\</emph\> and \<emph\>Columns\</emph\> must not lead to zero or negative start row or column.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id9051484				0	nb	Argumentene \<emph\>Høyde\</emph\> og \<emph\>Bredde\</emph\> kan ikke føre til null eller et negativt antall av rader eller kolonner.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_idN1104B				0	nb	            \<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/00/00000004.xhp#optional\"/\>         				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155586	120			0	nb	Eksempel				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3149744	121			0	nb	\<item type=\"input\"\>=FORSKYVNING(A1; 2; 2)\</item\> gir verdien i celle C3 (A1 flyttet med to rader og to kolonner nedover). Hvis C3 inneholder verdien \<item type=\"input\"\>100\</item\> gir denne funksjonen verdien 100.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id7439802				0	nb	\<item type=\"input\"\>=FORSKYVNING(B2:C3;1;1)\</item\> gir en referanse til B2:C3 flyttet 1 rad ned og en kolonne til høyre (C3:D4).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3009430				0	nb	\<item type=\"input\"\>=FORSKYVNING(B2:C3;-1;-1)\</item\> gir en referanse til B2:C3 flyttet 1 rad opp og en kolonne til venstre (A1:B2).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id2629169				0	nb	\<item type=\"input\"\>=FORSKYVNING(B2:C3;0;0;3;4)\</item\> gir en referanse til B2:C3 med størrelsen endret til 3 rader og 4 kolonner (B2:E4).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id6668599				0	nb	\<item type=\"input\"\>=FORSKYVNING(B2:C3;1;0;3;4)\</item\> gir en referanse til B2:C3 flyttet en rad ned og med størrelsen endret til 3 rader og 4 kolonner (B2:E4).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3153739	122			0	nb	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SUMMER(FORSKYVNING(A1;2;2;5;6))\</item\> bestemmer summen av området som starter i celle C3 og har en høyde på 5 rader og en bredde av 6 kolonner (område=C3:H7).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	bm_id3159273				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>SLÅ.OPP-funksjonen\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159273	123			0	nb	FINN.NÅ (LOOKUP på engelsk)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3153389	124			0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_VERWEIS\"\>Returns the contents of a cell either from a one-row or one-column range.\</ahelp\> Optionally, the assigned value (of the same index) is returned in a different column and row. As opposed to \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060109.xhp\" name=\"VLOOKUP\"\>VLOOKUP\</link\> and \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060109.xhp\" name=\"HLOOKUP\"\>HLOOKUP\</link\>, search and result vector may be at different positions; they do not have to be adjacent. Additionally, the search vector for the LOOKUP must be sorted ascending, otherwise the search will not return any usable results.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id4484084				0	nb	Hvis FINN.NÅ (LOOKUP på engelsk) ikke kan finne søkekriteriet, benyttes den største verdien i søkeretningen som er mindre enn eller lik søkekriteriet.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152947	125			0	nb	Syntaks				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3154104	126			0	nb	FINN.NÅ(Søkekriterium; Søkevektor; Resultatvektor)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3150646	127			0	nb	            \<emph\>SearchCriterion\</emph\> is the value to be searched for; entered either directly or as a reference.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3154854	128			0	nb	            \<emph\>SearchVector\</emph\> is the single-row or single-column area to be searched.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3149925	129			0	nb	            \<emph\>ResultVector\</emph\> is another single-row or single-column range from which the result of the function is taken. The result is the cell of the result vector with the same index as the instance found in the search vector.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148624	130			0	nb	Eksempel				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3149809	131			0	nb	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=LOOKUP(A1;D1:D100;F1:F100)\</item\> searches the corresponding cell in range D1:D100 for the number you entered in A1. For the instance found, the index is determined, for example, the 12th cell in this range. Then, the contents of the 12th cell are returned as the value of the function (in the result vector).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149425				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>STIL-funksjonen\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149425	133			0	nb	STIL (STYLE på engelsk)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3150826	134			0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_VORLAGE\"\>Applies a style to the cell containing the formula.\</ahelp\> After a set amount of time, another style can be applied. This function always returns the value 0, allowing you to add it to another function without changing the value. Together with the CURRENT function you can apply a color to a cell regardless of the value. For example: =...+STYLE(IF(CURRENT()>3;"red";"green")) applies the style "red" to the cell if the value is greater than 3, otherwise the style "green" is applied. Both cell formats have to be defined beforehand.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145373	135			0	nb	Syntaks				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3149302	136			0	nb	STIL("Stil"; Tid; "Stil2")				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3150596	137			0	nb	\<emph\>Stil\</emph\> er navnet på en cellestil tildelt cella. Stilnavn må tastes inn i hermetegn.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3156149	138			0	nb	\<emph\>Tid\</emph\> er en valgfri tidsperiode i sekunder. Hvis denne parameteren mangler, vil ikke stilen bli endret etter et bestemt tidsrom.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3149520	139			0	nb	\<emph\>Stil2\</emph\> er den valgfrie cellestilen tildelt cella etter et bestemt tidsrom. Hvis denne parameteren mangler vil "Standard" bli benyttet.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_idN111CA				0	nb	            \<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/00/00000004.xhp#optional\"/\>         				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159254	140			0	nb	Eksempel				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3151374	141			0	nb	\<item type=\"input\"\>=STIL("Usynlig";60;"Standard")\</item\> formaterer cella i gjennomsiktig format i 60 sekunder etter dokumentet ble omberegnet (eller lest inn), deretter vil standardformat bli brukt. Begge celleformatene må være angitt på forhånd.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id8056886				0	nb	Da STIL() har en numerisk returverdi på null, blir denne returverdien lagt til en streng. Dette kan unngås ved å bruke T() som i det følgende eksempelet 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3668935				0	nb	\<item type=\"input\"\>="Tekst"&T(STIL"minStil"))\</item\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3042085				0	nb	Se også GJELDENDE() for et annet eksempel.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150430				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>VELG-funksjonen\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150430	142			0	nb	VELG (CHOOSE på engelsk)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3143270	143			0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_WAHL\"\>Bruker en indeks for å hente en verdi fra en liste med opptil 30 verdier.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153533	144			0	nb	Syntaks				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3155425	145			0	nb	VELG(Indeks; Verdi1; ...; Verdi30)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3144755	146			0	nb	            \<emph\>Indeks\</emph\> er en referanse eller et tall mellom 1 og 30, som angir hvilke verdier som skal tas fra lista.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3149939	147			0	nb	            \<emph\>Verdi1...Verdi30\</emph\> er lista med verdier skrevet inn som en referanse til en celle eller som individuelle verdier.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151253	148			0	nb	Eksempel				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3150625	149			0	nb	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=VELG(A1; B1; B2; B3; "I dag"; "I går"; "I morgen")\</item\>, gir for eksempel innholdet av celle B2 til A1 = 2; for A1 = 4 vil funksjonen returnere teksten "I dag".				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151001				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>FINN.KOLONNE-funksjonen\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151001	151			0	nb	FINN.KOLONNE (HLOOKUP på engelsk)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3148688	152			0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_WVERWEIS\"\>Søker etter en verdi og en referanse til cellene nedenfor det merkede området.\</ahelp\> Funksjonen sjekker om den første raden i en tabell inneholder en viss verdi. Funksjonen gir så verdien i en rad i tabellen, angitt av \<emph\>Indeks\</emph\>, i den samme kolonnen.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154661	153			0	nb	Syntaks				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3146070	154			0	nb	FINN.KOLONNE(Søkekriterier; Matrise; Indeks; Sortert)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3148672	155			0	nb	See also:\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060109.xhp\" name=\"VLOOKUP\"\>VLOOKUP\</link\> (columns and rows are exchanged)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147321				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>RAD-funksjonen\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147321	157			0	nb	RAD				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3154564	203			0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ZEILE\"\>Returns the row number of a cell reference.\</ahelp\> If the reference is a cell, it returns the row number of the cell. If the reference is a cell range, it returns the corresponding row numbers in a one-column \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060107.xhp#wasmatrix\" name=\"Array\"\>Array\</link\> if the formula is entered \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060107.xhp#somatrixformel\" name=\"as an array formula\"\>as an array formula\</link\>. If the ROW function with a range reference is not used in an array formula, only the row number of the first range cell will be returned.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id3158439	159			0	nb	Syntaks				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3154916	160			0	nb	REKKE(Referanse)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3156336	161			0	nb	            \<emph\>Referanse\</emph\> er en celle, et område eller navnet på et område.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3151109	204			0	nb	Hvis du ikke angir en referanse, vil radnummeret for cellen hvor formlen er skrevet inn bli funnet.\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Calc angir automatisk referansen til den gjeldende cella.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155609	162			0	nb	Eksempel				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3154830	205			0	nb	            \<item type=\"input\"\>RAD(B3)\</item\> gir 3, fordi referansen henviser til den tredje raden i tabellen.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3147094	206			0	nb	            \<item type=\"input\"\>{=RAD(D5:D8)}\</item\> gir matrisen med enkeltkolonnen (5, 6, 7, 8), fordi den angitte referansen inneholder radene 5 til 8.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3153701	207			0	nb	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=RAD(D5:D8)\</item\> gir 5 fordi REKKE-funksjonen ikke blir brukt som matriseformel og bare nummeret på den første raden i referansen returneres.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3150996	208			0	nb	            \<item type=\"input\"\>{=ROW(A1:E1)}\</item\> and \<item type=\"input\"\>=ROW(A1:E1)\</item\> both return 1 because the reference only contains row 1 as the first row in the table. (Because single-row areas only have one row number it does not make any difference whether or not the formula is used as an array formula.)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3153671	209			0	nb	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=RAD()\</item\> gir 3 hvis formelen ble skrevet inn i rad 3.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3153790	210			0	nb	            \<item type=\"input\"\>{=RAD(Kanin)}\</item\> gir matrisen med enkeltkolonnen (1, 2, 3) hvis "Kanin" er det navngitte området (C1:D3).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145772				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>RADER-funksjon\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145772	166			0	nb	RADER (ROWS på engelsk)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3148971	167			0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ZEILEN\"\>Gir antall rader i en referanse eller tabell.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156051	168			0	nb	Syntaks				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3154357	169			0	nb	RADER(Matrise)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3155942	170			0	nb	            \<emph\>Matrise\</emph\> er referansen eller det navngitte området som totale antall rader skal oppdages for.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155869	171			0	nb	Eksempel				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3154725	212			0	nb	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=Rader(B5)\</item\> gir 1, fordi en celle inneholder kun en enkelt rad.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3150102	172			0	nb	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=RADER(A10:B12)\</item\> gir 3.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3155143	213			0	nb	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=RADER(Kanin)\</item\> gir 3, hvis "Kanin" er det navngitte området (C1:D3).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	bm_id9959410				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>HYPERLENKE-funksjon\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_idN11798				0	nb	HYPERLENKE				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_idN117F1				0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_HYPERLINK\"\>Når du trykker på en celle som inneholder HYPERLENKE-funksjonen vil hyperlenka åpnes.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_idN11800				0	nb	If you use the optional \<emph\>CellText\</emph\> parameter, the formula locates the URL, and then displays the text or number.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_idN11803				0	nb	For å åpne en hyperlenka celle med tastaturet, velg cella, trykk «F2» for å gå i redigeringsmodus, flytt pekeren foran hyperlenka, trykke «Shift+F10» og velg så\<emph\>Åpne hyperlenke\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_idN1180A				0	nb	Syntaks				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_idN1180E				0	nb	HYPERLENKE("URL") eller HYPERLENKE("URL"; "Celletekst")				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_idN11811				0	nb	            \<emph\>URL\</emph\> specifies the link target. The optional \<emph\>CellText\</emph\> parameter is the text or a number that is displayed in the cell and will be returned as the result. If the \<emph\>CellText\</emph\> parameter is not specified, the \<emph\>URL\</emph\> is displayed in the cell text and will be returned as the result.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id0907200912224576				0	nb	The number 0 is returned for empty cells and matrix elements.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_idN11823				0	nb	Eksempel				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_idN11827				0	nb	\<item type=\"input\"\>=HYPERLENKE("http://www.eksempel.org")\</item\> viser teksten "http://www.eksempel.org" i cella og åpner hyperlenka http://www.eksempel.org når det trykkes på cella.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_idN1182A				0	nb	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=HYPERLENKE("http://www.eksempel.org";"Trykk her")\</item\> viser teksten "Trykk her" i cella og åpner hyperlenka http://www.eksempel.org når det trykkes på cella.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id0907200912224534				0	nb	=HYPERLINK("http://www.example.org";12345) displays the number 12345 and executes the hyperlink http://www.example.org when clicked.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_idN1182D				0	nb	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=HYPERLENKE($B4)\</item\> hvor celle B4 inneholder \<item type=\"input\"\>http://www.eksempel.org"\</item\>. Funksjonen legger "http://www.eksempel.org" til URL'en i hyperlenkecella og gir den samme teksten som brukes som formelresultat.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_idN11830				0	nb	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=HYPERLENKE("http://www."; "Trykk ") & "eksempel.org"\</item\> viser teksten "Trykk eksempel.org" i cella og åpner hyperlenka http://www.eksempel.org når det trykkes på cella.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id8859523				0	nb	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=HYPERLENKE("#Sheet1.A1";"Go to top")\</item\> viser teksten Gå til toppen og hopper til cella Ark1.A1 i dette dokumentet.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id2958769				0	nb	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=HYPERLINK("file:///C:/writer.odt#Specification";"Go to Writer bookmark")\</item\>displays the text Go to Writer bookmark, loads the specified text document and jumps to bookmark "Specification".				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	bm_id7682424				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>HENTPIVOTDATA-funksjon\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id3747062				0	nb	HENTPIVOTDATA				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3593859				0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The GETPIVOTDATA function returns a result value from a pivot table. The value is addressed using field and item names, so it remains valid if the layout of the pivot table changes.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id9741508				0	nb	Syntaks				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id909451				0	nb	To forskjellige syntaksdefinisjoner kan brukes:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id1665089				0	nb	GETPIVOTDATA(TargetField; pivot table; [ Field 1; Item 1; ... ])				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id4997100				0	nb	GETPIVOTDATA(pivot table; Constraints)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id1672109				0	nb	Syntaks nr. 2 antas å være brukt hvis eksakt to parametre er gitt, hvor den første parameteren er en referanse til en celle eller et celleområde. Det første syntaks antas å være brukt i alle andre tilfeller. Funksjonsveiviseren viser det første syntaks.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id9464094				0	nb	Første syntaks				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id9302346				0	nb	            \<emph\>TargetField\</emph\> is a string that selects one of the pivot table's data fields. The string can be the name of the source column, or the data field name as shown in the table (like "Sum - Sales").				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id8296151				0	nb	            \<emph\>pivot table\</emph\> is a reference to a cell or cell range that is positioned within a pivot table or contains a pivot table. If the cell range contains several pivot tables, the table that was created last is used.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id4809411				0	nb	If no \<emph\>Field n / Item n\</emph\> pairs are given, the grand total is returned. Otherwise, each pair adds a constraint that the result must satisfy. \<emph\>Field n\</emph\> is the name of a field from the pivot table. \<emph\>Item n\</emph\> is the name of an item from that field.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id6454969				0	nb	If the pivot table contains only a single result value that fulfills all of the constraints, or a subtotal result that summarizes all matching values, that result is returned. If there is no matching result, or several ones without a subtotal for them, an error is returned. These conditions apply to results that are included in the pivot table.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id79042				0	nb	If the source data contains entries that are hidden by settings of the pivot table, they are ignored. The order of the Field/Item pairs is not significant. Field and item names are not case-sensitive.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id7928708				0	nb	If no constraint for a page field is given, the field's selected value is implicitly used. If a constraint for a page field is given, it must match the field's selected value, or an error is returned. Page fields are the fields at the top left of a pivot table, populated using the "Page Fields" area of the pivot table layout dialog. From each page field, an item (value) can be selected, which means only that item is included in the calculation.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3864253				0	nb	Subtotal values from the pivot table are only used if they use the function "auto" (except when specified in the constraint, see \<item type=\"literal\"\>Second Syntax\</item\> below).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144016				0	nb	Andre syntaks				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id9937131				0	nb	            \<emph\>pivot table\</emph\> has the same meaning as in the first syntax.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id5616626				0	nb	            \<emph\>Constraints\</emph\> is a space-separated list. Entries can be quoted (single quotes). The whole string must be enclosed in quotes (double quotes), unless you reference the string from another cell.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id4076357				0	nb	One of the entries can be the data field name. The data field name can be left out if the pivot table contains only one data field, otherwise it must be present.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id8231757				0	nb	Each of the other entries specifies a constraint in the form \<item type=\"literal\"\>Field[Item]\</item\> (with literal characters [ and ]), or only \<item type=\"literal\"\>Item\</item\> if the item name is unique within all fields that are used in the pivot table.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3168736				0	nb	Et funksjonsnavn kan legges til på formen \<emph\>felt[element;funksjon]\</emph\>, hvilket betyr at kriteriene bare passer på delsumverdier som bruker denne funksjonen. De mulige funksjonsnavnene er Summer, Antall, Middel, Maks, Min, Produkt, Antall (kun tall), Stdav, Stdavp, Varians, og Variansp. Det skille ikke mellom store og små bokstaver.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	tit				0	nb	Tekstfunksjoner				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145389				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>tekst i celler; funksjoner\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>funksjoner; tekstfunksjoner\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Funksjonsveiviser; tekst\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
