helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145166				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>DESIMAL-funksjonen\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145166	225			0	nb	DESIMAL				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3156361	226			0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_DEZIMAL\"\>Converts text with characters from a \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#zahlensystem\" name=\"number system\"\>number system\</link\> to a positive integer in the base radix given.\</ahelp\> The radix must be in the range 2 to 36. Spaces and tabs are ignored. The \<emph\>Text\</emph\> field is not case-sensitive.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3157994	227			0	nb	If the radix is 16, a leading x or X or 0x or 0X, and an appended h or H, is disregarded. If the radix is 2, an appended b or B is disregarded. Other characters that do not belong to the number system generate an error.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150014	228			0	nb	Syntaks				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3154328	229			0	nb	DESIMAL("Tekst"; Grunntall)				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3150128	230			0	nb	            \<emph\>Text\</emph\> is the text to be converted. To differentiate between a hexadecimal number, such as A1 and the reference to cell A1, you must place the number in quotation marks, for example, "A1" or "FACE".				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3145241	231			0	nb	            \<emph\>Radix\</emph\> indicates the base of the number system. It may be any positive integer between 2 and 36.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156062	232			0	nb	Eksempel				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3145355	233			0	nb	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=DECIMAL("17";10)\</item\> returns 17.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3155622	234			0	nb	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=DECIMAL("FACE";16)\</item\> returns 64206.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3151015	235			0	nb	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=DECIMAL("0101";2)\</item\> returns 5.				20130618 17:22:18
