helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_idN107E7				0	nb	Du kan også bruke =ER.SKUDDÅR("1968-02-29") eller =ER.SKUDDÅR("29/2/68").				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_idN107EA				0	nb	Never use =ISLEAPYEAR(2/29/68), because this would first evaluate 2 divided by 29 divided by 68, and then calculate the ISLEAPYEAR function from this small number as a serial date number.				20130618 17:22:18
