helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060112.xhp	0	help	par_id3159119	36			0	nb	Input: Any number of types (double&, char*, double*, char**, Cell area), where the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060112.xhp\" name=\"Cell area\"\>Cell area\</link\> is an array of types double array, string array, or cell array.				20130618 17:22:18
