helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154222	340			0	nb	What are the periodic payments at a yearly interest rate of 1.99% if the payment time is 3 years and the cash value is 25,000 currency units. There are 36 months as 36 payment periods, and the interest rate per payment period is 1.99%/12.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3155943	341			0	nb	\<item type=\"input\"\>=PMT(1.99%/12;36;25000)\</item\> = -715.96 currency units. The periodic monthly payment is therefore 715.96 currency units.				20130618 17:22:18
