helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3148645	3			0	nb	Select the rows or columns that you want to hide, and then choose \<emph\>Format - Row - Hide \</emph\>or\<emph\> Format - Column - Hide\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3147427	6			0	nb	You can hide a sheet by selecting the sheet tab and then choosing \<emph\>Format - Sheet - Hide\</emph\>. Hidden sheets are not printed unless they occur within a \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/05080000.xhp\" name=\"print range\"\>print range\</link\>.				20130618 17:22:18
