helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148868	33			0	nb	Tilpass utskriftsområde(r) til antall sider				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3145074	34			0	nb	Specifies the maximum number of pages on which every sheet with the current Page Style is to be printed. The scale will be reduced as necessary to fit the defined number of pages.				20130618 17:22:18
