helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155855	2			0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Behandle utskriftsområder. Bare celler i utskriftsområdet vil bli skrevet ut.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146119	4			0	nb	If you do not define any print range manually, Calc assigns an automatic print range to include all the cells that are not empty.				20130618 17:22:18
