helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147265	4			0	nb	Traces are displayed in the sheet with marking arrows. At the same time, the range of all the cells contained in the formula of the current cell is highlighted with a blue frame.				20130618 17:22:18
