helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06070000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145673	1			0	nb	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/06070000.xhp\" name=\"AutoCalculate\"\>Automatisk beregning\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148798	2			0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AutomaticCalculation\"\>Oppdater automatisk alle utregninger av formler i dokumentet.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145173	3			0	nb	All cells are recalculated after a sheet cell has been modified. Any charts in the sheet will also be refreshed.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	nb	Omberegn				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3157909				0	nb	\<bookmark_value\>recalculating;all formulas in sheets\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>formulas; recalculating manually\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>cell contents; recalculating\</bookmark_value\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157909	1			0	nb	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/06080000.xhp\" name=\"Recalculate\"\>Recalculate\</link\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154758	2			0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Calculate\"\>Recalculates all changed formulas. If AutoCalculate is enabled, the Recalculate command applies only to formulas like RAND or NOW.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id315475899				0	nb	Press F9 to recalculate. Press Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F9 to recalculate all formulas in the document.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150793	5			0	nb	After the document has been recalculated, the display is refreshed. All charts are also refreshed.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id315475855				0	nb	The Add-In functions like RANDBETWEEN currently cannot respond to the Recalculate command or F9. Press Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F9 to recalculate all formulas, including the Add-In functions.				20130618 17:22:18
