helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156280	3			0	nb	Vis feilmelding når ugyldige verdier skrives inn.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150768	4			0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays the error message that you enter in the \<emph\>Contents\</emph\> area when invalid data is entered in a cell.\</ahelp\> If enabled, the message is displayed to prevent an invalid entry.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3146984	5			0	nb	I begge tilfeller, hvis du velger «Stopp», blir det ugyldige elementet slettet og forrige verdi blir satt inn på nytt i cellen. Det samme gjelder hvis du lukker dialogvinduene «Advarsel» og «Informasjon» ved å trykk på \<emph\>Avbryt\</emph\>-knappen. Hvis du lukker dialogvinduene med knappen \<emph\>OK\</emph\>, blir ikke det ugyldige elementet slettet.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152460	6			0	nb	Innhold				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148646	8			0	nb	Handling				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3151115	9			0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:LISTBOX:TP_VALIDATION_ERROR:LB_ACTION\"\>Select the action that you want to occur when invalid data is entered in a cell.\</ahelp\> The "Stop" action rejects the invalid entry and displays a dialog that you have to close by clicking \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. The "Warning" and "Information" actions display a dialog that can be closed by clicking \<emph\>OK\</emph\> or \<emph\>Cancel\</emph\>. The invalid entry is only rejected when you click \<emph\>Cancel\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156441	10			0	nb	Bla gjennom				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153160	11			0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:PUSHBUTTON:TP_VALIDATION_ERROR:BTN_SEARCH\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06130000.xhp\" name=\"Macro\"\>Macro\</link\> dialog where you can select the macro that is executed when invalid data is entered in a cell. The macro is executed after the error message is displayed.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
