helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_eastersunday.xhp	0	help	par_id3150940	184			0	nb	EASTERSUNDAY(2000)+49 returns the internal serial number 36688. The result is 2000-06-11. Format the serial date number as a date, for example in the format YYYY-MM-DD.				20130618 17:22:18
