helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_workday.xhp	0	help	par_id3152782	194			0	nb	What date came 17 workdays after 1 December 2001? Enter the start date "2001-12-01" in C3 and the number of workdays in D3. Cells F3 to J3 contain the following Christmas and New Year holidays: "2001-12-24", "2001-12-25", "2001-12-26", "2001-12-31", "2002-01-01".				20130618 17:22:18
