helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147285	7			0	nb	Aktiv hjelp				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3149716	8			0	nb	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010600.xhp\" name=\"Help Agent\"\>Aktiv hjelp\</link\> starter automatisk når du gjør noe som du kanskje trenger hjelp til. Aktiv hjelp vises i et eget lite vindu i hjørnet av dokumentet. Trykk i dette vinduet for å se hjelpen for den aktuelle oppgaven.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_idN10634				0	nb	The Help Agent automatically closes after a short delay. If you ignore or close the Help Agent three times you perform a certain task, the Help Agent no longer opens for that task. To disable the Help Agent choose \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\<emph\> - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149140	3			0	nb	Tips				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3157896	4			0	nb	Tipstekstene viser deg navnene på de ulike verktøylinjeknappene. Hold musepekeren over en knapp en liten stund for å se hva knappen heter.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3153910	9			0	nb	Tipstekster blir også vist for noen elementer i et dokument, som for eksempel kapittelnavn når du ruller gjennom et langt dokument.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id992156				0	nb	Enable or disable the tips on \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\<emph\> - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147571	5			0	nb	Utvidet tips				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3149346	6			0	nb	Utvidet tips gir en kort beskrivelse av knapper og kommandoer. Du kan vise et utvidet tips ved å trykke «Shift + F1» og holde musepekeren over knappen eller kommandoen.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_idN10666				0	nb	If you always want extended tips instead of tips, enable the extended tips on \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\<emph\> - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
