helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	hd_id344248				0	nb	\<variable id=\"digitalsign_send\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/digitalsign_send.xhp\"\>Applying Digital Signatures\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN1063C				0	nb	Anskaffe et sertifikat				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN10640				0	nb	You can get a certificate from a certification authority, which may be a private company or a governmental institution. Some certification authorities want money for their service, for example when they certify your identity. Other certificates are free of costs, for example those offered by some e-mail providers, which certify your e-mail address. A few of the companies that offer certificates to private persons are listed in the following, in alphabetical order: \<link href=\"http://www.globalsign.net\"\>GlobalSign\</link\>, \<link href=\"http://www.verisign.com\"\>Verisign\</link\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F6				0	nb	Håndtere sertifikatene dine				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN1070A				0	nb	Hvis du bruker Microsoft Windows, kan du håndtere sertifikatene dine fra Kontrollpanelet under «Internettinnstillinger » (velg fanen «Innhold«).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_id8311410				0	nb	Import your new root certificate into the Trusted Root Certification Authorities list.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN1071D				0	nb	Hvis du bruker Solaris eller Linux må du installere en av de nyeste versjonene av Thunderbird, Mozilla Suite eller Firefox, for å installere systemfiler som er nødvendige for krypteringen.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN10720				0	nb	Hvis du har laget forskjellige profiler i Thunderbird, Mozilla eller Firefox, og du ønsker at %PRODUCTNAME skal bruke en av dem til sertifikater, så kan du angi en miljøvariabel MOZILLA_CERTIFICATE_FOLDER for å peke på mappen med den ønskede profilen.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_id944242				0	nb	Åpne dialogvinduet for innstillinger i nettleseren din, velg Privatliv og Sikkerhet, klikk på Sertifikater → Administrer sertifikater. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_id6452223				0	nb	Importer det nye rotsertifikatet ditt. Velg sertifikatet og rediger det. Slå på rotsertifikatet til å være betrodd for nett- og e-post-adgang. Dette sikrer at sertifikatet kan signere dokumentene dine. Du kan redigere et hvilket som helst mellomliggende sertifikat på samme måte, men det er ikke et krav for å signerer dokumenter.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_id6486098				0	nb	Start %PRODUCTNAME på nytt når du har redigert de nye sertifikatene.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN10681				0	nb	Signere et dokument				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN10688				0	nb	Velg \<emph\>Fil → Digitale signaturer\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN10690				0	nb	En meldingsboks gjør deg oppmerksom på at du skal lagre dokumentet. Klikk på \<emph\>Ja\</emph\> for å lagre filen.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN10698				0	nb	Når du har lagret dokumentet, åpnes dialogvinduet \<link href=\"text/shared/01/digitalsignatures.xhp\"\>Digitale signaturer\</link\>. Trykk på \<emph\>Legg til\</emph\> for å legge til en offentlig nøkkel i dokumentet.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN106AE				0	nb	I dialogvinduet \<link href=\"text/shared/01/selectcertificate.xhp\"\>Velg sertifikat\</link\> velg sertifikatet ditt og klikk OK. 				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C0				0	nb	Du ser igjen dialogen Digitale signaturer, hvor du kan legge til flere sertifikater, hvis du vil. Klikk på OK for å legge den offentlige nøkkelen til den lagrede filen.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C3				0	nb	A signed document shows an icon \<image id=\"img_id262764\" src=\"xmlsecurity/res/certificate_16.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id262764\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> in the status bar. You can double-click the icon in the status bar to view the certificate.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_id2008200911381426				0	nb	The result of the signature validation is displayed in the status bar and within the Digital Signature dialog. Several documents and macro signatures can exist inside an ODF document. If there is a problem with one signature, then the validation result of that one signature is assumed for all signatures. That is, if there are ten valid signatures and one invalid signature, then the status bar and the status field in the dialog will flag the signature as invalid.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E0				0	nb	Signering av makroene i et dokument				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E4				0	nb	Normalt er makroer er del av et dokument. Hvis du signerer et dokument, blir makroene i dokumentet automatisk signert. Hvis du bare vil signere makroene og ikke dokumentet, skal du gjøre dette:				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EA				0	nb	Velg \<emph\>Verktøy → Makroer → Digital signatur\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F2				0	nb	Legg til signaturen, som beskrevet ovenfor for dokumenter.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F5				0	nb	When you open the Basic IDE that contains signed macros, you see an icon \<image id=\"img_id9252296\" src=\"xmlsecurity/res/certificate_16.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id9252296\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> in the status bar. You can double-click the icon in the status bar to view the certificate.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_id5734733				0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Klikk for å åpne dialogvinduet Vis sertifikat.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_id561540				0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Velg denne innstillinga for å godta sertifikatet til du avslutter %PRODUCTNAME.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_send.xhp	0	help	par_id7705618				0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Velg denne instillinga for å avbryte tilkoblingen.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
