helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\labels.xhp	0	help	par_id3146798	70			0	nb	Velg \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01010300.xhp\" name=\"File - New - Business Cards\"\>\<emph\>Fil → Ny → Visittkort\</emph\>\</link\> for å åpne dialogvinduet \<emph\>Visittkort\</emph\>, der du kan velge hvordan visittkortene skal se ut.				20130618 17:22:18
