helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000003.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EE				0	nb	pi				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000003.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F4				0	nb	Pica				20130618 17:22:18
