helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147230	65			0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Rect\"\>Tegn en firkant. For å tegne et kvadrat, hold inne Shift-knappen når du drar med musa.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153367	20			0	nb	Ellipse				20130618 17:22:18
