helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3158444	17			0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Edit\"\>Lag et tekstfelt\</ahelp\>Tekstfelt er felt der brukeren kan skrive inn tekst. I skjemaer viser tekstfeltene data eller lar deg skrive inn nye data.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151218	124			0	nb	Formatert felt				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154836				0	nb	\<image id=\"img_id3143277\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_formattedfield.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3143277\"\>Ikon\</alt\>\</image\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147547	125			0	nb	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FormattedField\"\>Lag et formatert felt.\</ahelp\> Et formatert felt er et tekstfelt der du kan avgjøre hvordan inndata og utdata skal formateres, og hva grenseverdiene skal være.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155346	126			0	nb	Formaterte felt har \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170002.xhp\" name=\"special control properties\"\>spesielle kontrollegenskaper\</link\> (velg \<emph\>Format → Kontrollelement\</emph\>).				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148774	6			0	nb	Trykknapp				20130618 17:22:18
