helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	hd_id8773155				0	nb	\<variable id=\"rep_main\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/rep_main.xhp\"\>Rapportbyggeren\</link\>\</variable\>				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id5248573				0	nb	Rapportbyggeren er et verktøy for å lage dine egne databaserapporter. I motsetning til \<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01100000.xhp\"\>Rapportveiviseren\</link\>, kan Rapportbyggeren brukes for å lage rapporten slik du vil ha den. Den opprettede rapporten er et Writer-dokument som du også kan redigere.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id7128818				0	nb	For å bruke Rapportbyggeren, må utvidelsen Rapportbygger installeres. I tillegg må Java Runtime Environment (JRE)-programvare installeres og denne må velges i %PRODUCTNAME.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	hd_id3753776				0	nb	For å installere utvidelsen Rapportbygger				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id5284279				0	nb	Velg Verktøy → Utvidelser for å åpne \<link href=\"text/shared/01/packagemanager.xhp\"\>Utvidelser\</link\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id4494766				0	nb	If you see the Report Builder in the Extension Manager list, then you do not need to install the extension. Else click the link "Get more extensions here". This opens your web browser at the address \<link href=\"http://extensions.services.openoffice.org\"\>http://extensions.services.openoffice.org\</link\> and shows a list of available extensions.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id7858516				0	nb	Find the Report Builder extension. Click at the icon or the "click here" text link. This opens the download page for the extension.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id973540				0	nb	Click the "Get it!" icon. The extension file will be downloaded to your computer.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id4680928				0	nb	Gå tilbake fra nettleseren til vinduet for %PRODUCTNAME. Vinduet Utvidelser skal enda være synlig.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id9014252				0	nb	I Utvidelser, klikk «Legg til» for å åpne dialogvinduet «Legg til utvidelse».				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id6011841				0	nb	Select the extension file that you downloaded. Click Open.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id2591326				0	nb	This starts the installation of the Report Builder extension.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id6201666				0	nb	Les lisensen. Hvis du godtar lisensen, klikk Godta for å fortsette installasjonen.				20130618 17:22:18
