helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id9636524				0	nb	Først må du bestemme om du vil redigere den opprettede rapporten, som er et fast Writer-dokument, eller om du vil redigere Rapportbyggerens visning og opprette en ny rapport basert på den nye utformingen.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id5941648				0	nb	The Writer document is opened read-only. To edit the Writer document, click Edit File\<image id=\"img_id8237556\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_editdoc.png\" width=\"0.566cm\" height=\"0.566cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id8237556\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> on the Standard toolbar.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id8307138				0	nb	Hvis du vil redigere Rapportbyggerens visning, du kan forandre noen av de tilhørende egenskapene.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id7138889				0	nb	Klikk i Detalj-området. Klikk så vinduet Egenskaper, forandre noen egenskaper, for eksempel bakgrunnsfargen.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id9869380				0	nb	After finishing, click the Execute Report icon\<image id=\"Graphic2\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_executereport.png\" width=\"0.566cm\" height=\"0.566cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> to create a new report.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id12512				0	nb	Hvis du lukker Rapportbyggeren, vil du bli spurt om rapporten skal lagres. Klikk, Ja, gi rapporten et navn, og klikk OK.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id2676168				0	nb	Sortere rapporten				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id2626422				0	nb	Uten sortering eller gruppering, vil postene bli satt inn i rapporten i den rekkefølgen de blir hentet ut fra databasen.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id1743827				0	nb	Open the Report Builder view and click the Sorting and Grouping icon\<image id=\"img_id9557786\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_dbsortingandgrouping.png\" width=\"0.566cm\" height=\"0.566cm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id9557786\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> on the toolbar. You see the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/rep_sort.xhp\"\>Sorting and Grouping\</link\> dialog.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id4331797				0	nb	I Gruppeboksen, klikk feltet som du vil ha som det første sorteringsfeltet, og sett egenskapen for Sortering.				20130618 17:22:18
